Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:30.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:40.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm in position, move in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.75,0:02:42.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where is Juntao?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.71,0:02:44.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Juntao? He is everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.42,0:02:48.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You want a piece of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:50.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.29,0:02:53.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shoot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.06,0:02:58.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shoot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:03:59.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sang got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.35,0:04:05.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Forgive me, Consul Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:10.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I believe we can ill afford to lose men of your high character.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:13.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And speaking as a friend who's fought side by side with you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:17.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,for 15 years...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.27,0:04:20.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I will miss the unshakable support you've given the Royal Hong Kong Police.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.51,0:04:23.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,On behalf of all Brits
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:26.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,who have ever carried the shield in Hong Kong
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.51,0:04:27.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,we shall miss you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:28.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And we wish you happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.85,0:04:31.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,as you take up your new post in the United States.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.82,0:04:35.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, Consul Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.95,0:04:37.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.83,0:04:42.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:45.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thomas is not going to make this evening easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:46.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:54.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Commander Griffin
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.30,0:04:59.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I am pleased to leave you and Hong Kong with a special gift tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:03.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Earlier, Detective Inspector Lee and his special task force
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.68,0:05:07.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,have once and for all crushed the Juntao criminal organization
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:11.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and reclaimed artifacts from 5000 years of China's heritage
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.99,0:05:19.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is the kind of legacy I dreamt about.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.89,0:05:21.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hong Kong forever
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.73,0:05:24.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,To Hong Kong, forever
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.64,0:05:32.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Soo Yung.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.67,0:05:35.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you tell me you weren't going with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.18,0:05:36.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was trying to find the right time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:38.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,When? After I left?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:43.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Soo Yung, I'll miss you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.95,0:05:45.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're my best student!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:47.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your mother would've been proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:52.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you practice your kicks and eye gouges?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:54.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't like America.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.63,0:05:56.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I won't have any friend in America.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:06:01.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything will be O.K. I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:04.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:06.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.94,0:06:07.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.87,0:06:10.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,America is a very friendly place.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.70,0:06:14.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stupid fool, get out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.61,0:06:16.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Man, are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.45,0:06:17.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shoot!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:18.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You moron!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:27.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Clive, what's up, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.69,0:06:30.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:32.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm late? Yeah, you're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.03,0:06:35.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I've been waiting inside for an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:36.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was in the diner.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.73,0:06:37.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I told you, "the back of the diner."
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:39.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You thought I'd do this up front?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.44,0:06:41.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy? I'll get busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:42.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was in the diner, you weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.64,0:06:45.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I said... It don't even matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:47.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm late, you late, it don't matter. Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.64,0:06:49.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's that? Put that gun away.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:50.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How many people you killed this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.48,0:06:53.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop it. Come on, let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.42,0:06:54.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't be late again.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:55.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I ain't going to be late. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.19,0:07:01.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's tight. That's beautiful. That's nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.66,0:07:03.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's that? That's C-4.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:05.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's C-4? That's C-4.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.89,0:07:07.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:08.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's the problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.73,0:07:10.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ain't no problem. I been looking everywhere for this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:12.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How the hell you find some C-4?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:14.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't know how you're making me feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:16.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The Iraqis can't even get this shit
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.74,0:07:18.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who'd you get this from?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:20.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a hot ticket.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.01,0:07:21.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't know how happy you made me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:24.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You got what I want. I'll get what you want. Let me get that money.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:25.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Step away from the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.15,0:07:29.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Officers. Hands above your heads.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.02,0:07:30.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, officers?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.85,0:07:33.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just do it. No problem here. Why mess with us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.79,0:07:36.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take it easy, buddy! You don't want to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.76,0:07:37.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:39.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, he don't. He's just playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.36,0:07:40.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I ain't playing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.26,0:07:42.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, he is, officer!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.26,0:07:44.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Drop the gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:46.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's my cousin. We're talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.33,0:07:47.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get back in the car and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:48.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We can't do that, buddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:51.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going to blow his head all over the parking lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:53.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get in the car and buy some doughnuts.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:56.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,See what you did? You made him mad. Let me talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.94,0:07:58.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:03.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything cool now. He down, the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:04.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now get back in the car and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:05.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Put your hands on your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.78,0:08:07.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Officer, everything cool, officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:09.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.64,0:08:29.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you to get in the car?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:53.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop it! I got C-4 in the trunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:22.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Clive... guess what, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.49,0:09:25.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I forgot to tell you. I'm LAPD.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:27.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You under arrest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.65,0:09:35.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Soo Yung, come on. We're going to be late.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.23,0:09:36.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.50,0:09:38.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.74,0:09:42.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Telephone. China.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.94,0:09:46.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Soo Yung.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:49.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I love you. Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:50.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you be home after school?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.15,0:09:56.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No. I am going to pick you up myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:02.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Good-bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.10,0:10:15.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Han. Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.95,0:10:28.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,When you walk by every night
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:30.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,talking sweet and looking fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:35.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I get kind of hectic inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:37.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Baby, I'm so into you
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.62,0:10:39.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Darling, if you only knew
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:44.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,all the things that flow through my mind
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:07.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is there a problem officer?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.28,0:11:10.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No problem. Just rush hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:07.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Security's in place?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:10.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're sure the exhibits will be ready this weekend?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:14.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir. Your opening remarks are scheduled for 7:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:16.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Consul Han...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.95,0:12:20.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm Warren Russ with the Federal Bureau of Investigation
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:24.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is Agent Whitney. We need to speak with you in private, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.66,0:12:27.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.97,0:12:37.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know this is a difficult time for you, consul...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.74,0:12:40.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but I want you to know, we'll get your daughter back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.27,0:12:42.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Will you get her back alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:45.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have the best agents in the world in this house and on those streets.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:49.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I would like one of my people to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.98,0:12:51.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me assure you, Consul,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:53.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,the FBI considers this a top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:56.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have plenty of people on the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:12:58.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Russ, I am not an American.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:00.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My daughter, she is not an American.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:02.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I understand that, sir, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.26,0:13:04.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's already on a plane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.79,0:13:09.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I trust you will treat him with the same courtesy as you have shown me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.90,0:13:12.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:14.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ten people jumped out.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.80,0:13:17.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I started slapping and throwing them everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.84,0:13:19.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then two stupid cops came and messed everything up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.67,0:13:23.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I had to save their life. It might be in the paper...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.41,0:13:25.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I saved their life and then
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.48,0:13:27.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I start running and trying to get the bomb...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.52,0:13:30.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you went without me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:31.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll talk to y'all later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.82,0:13:33.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you the best part after work.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:36.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is why nobody will work with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:39.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why you're the only cop in the department without a partner
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:40.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnson, look, first of all:
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.73,0:13:43.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If you want to go on a date, you'll have to wait on the list
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:45.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,like every other woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:47.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And second of all: I work alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.23,0:13:48.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want no partner. Don't need no partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.87,0:13:50.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And I'll never have a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.40,0:13:51.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Did Kojak have a partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.37,0:13:52.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The fat guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:54.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He wasn't never with him. Did Columbo have a partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.87,0:13:56.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Captain Diel ordered me to go with you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.51,0:13:58.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,because you needed bomb squad backup.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:01.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But once again, you screwed me and you screwed yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.21,0:14:02.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, Johnson, it's dangerous out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.95,0:14:05.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's safer for you to be here behind the desk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:08.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We were supposed to be on the same team.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.65,0:14:10.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Team? Johnson, this is the LAPD.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.46,0:14:12.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We the most hated cops in the free world.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:15.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My own mama ashamed of me. She tell everybody I'm a drug dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.33,0:14:17.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ain't no team. It's a pit stop for me, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:19.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm on the verge of leaving all y'all suckers behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:22.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Actually, you're on the verge of being suspended.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:24.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Have a nice day.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.04,0:14:31.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Somebody said I was getting suspended?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.28,0:14:34.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Quit playing, girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.85,0:14:38.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:41.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnson, somebody told you I was getting suspended?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.52,0:14:45.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.76,0:14:48.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All I need is a foreign national getting his head blown off...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.19,0:14:50.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and turning this into an international incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.63,0:14:52.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What can we do? He's on his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.53,0:14:56.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Call the field office. Have them send over a rookie.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.87,0:14:59.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll have him escort this guy around town for a couple of days
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:01.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,pretend to follow leads, show him some sights,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:03.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,keep him out of our way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.14,0:15:06.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Warren, you sure you want to do that to one of our own men?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:07.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you suggest?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.04,0:15:11.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,As long as we're going to humiliate someone...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.81,0:15:14.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,might as well be LAPD.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.85,0:15:18.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Even if I had an extra man,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.22,0:15:20.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,who would want such a bullshit assignment?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:22.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, it's a disgrace to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.69,0:15:26.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a disgrace to my department. It's a disgrace to...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.23,0:15:31.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Dan, I'm sending someone right over.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:37.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cap... I know you read the paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.00,0:15:39.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They lying. You know I wouldn't do nothing like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.17,0:15:40.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They over-exaggerate. You know how the paper is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.67,0:15:41.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They just want a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:43.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Two officers were shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.14,0:15:44.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,One man lost a pinkie.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:45.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But didn't nobody die.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:47.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You destroyed half a city block.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.41,0:15:48.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That block was already messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:50.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And you lost a lot of evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.25,0:15:51.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Still got a little bit left.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.45,0:15:54.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What you did was dangerous and completely against policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.92,0:15:56.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And not only that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.89,0:15:59.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You did a good job.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:01.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.83,0:16:06.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everyone around here is image-conscious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.43,0:16:09.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody's afraid of their own shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:11.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet an L.A. Detective who's willing to lay it on the line
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.27,0:16:14.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Captain, that's the way I feel.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:16.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what I've been trying to tell everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:18.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Every so often we have to let the public know
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.61,0:16:21.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,we can still blow shit up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.11,0:16:23.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You goddamn right! That's the only way I work, Cap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:25.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So I ain't getting suspended?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:27.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Suspended? Are you kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:28.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't even know why I said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.58,0:16:30.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I just got a call from the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.19,0:16:33.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A 10-year-old daughter of a Chinese diplomat was kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.86,0:16:35.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And they want you on the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.79,0:16:36.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,FBI wnat me?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.86,0:16:38.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:40.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop lying. I don't lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:42.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell the truth. I'm telling the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.63,0:16:45.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Captain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:46.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.57,0:16:48.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Appreciate it! You are going to the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.54,0:16:51.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going to look out for you when I go to the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.21,0:16:52.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll make you mayor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.17,0:16:53.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'd rather you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:59.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen up! If anybody need me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:03.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be working a big, big case for the FBI!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.47,0:17:22.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take care of that for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.68,0:17:39.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I need one of those earpieces immediately, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.65,0:17:41.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:44.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cross check the personned records with the new list from Interpol.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.59,0:17:49.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,See if you can make any matches or connections.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:51.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, boys, what do we got?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.73,0:17:53.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Have we checked the Consul personal records?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:55.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I want to know who's he been talking with,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:56.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,who's he been dealing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.27,0:17:58.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, give me the story. Any demands?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.70,0:18:00.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Any fingerprints? Have we interviewed his staff?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:04.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Whitney, who is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:05.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me a copy of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.61,0:18:08.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,James Carter, FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.01,0:18:11.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Warren, he's here for the special assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.02,0:18:17.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm Agent-in Charge Warren Russ.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.12,0:18:18.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's good to have you on board.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.15,0:18:19.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I been waiting for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.52,0:18:22.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You guys take a while to process an application.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:24.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Well, Carter...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.59,0:18:29.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,your particular assignment is considered G-14 classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:33.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't you and I take a walk and I'll fill you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:35.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, Warren.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.11,0:18:43.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,G-14 classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:44.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.85,0:18:46.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't understand, this is my dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.75,0:18:48.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm excited about working with the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.95,0:18:50.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm glad. Listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.55,0:18:54.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,His name is Lee, and the director considers this a top priority.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:57.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No disrespect, sir, but he'll get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.22,0:18:58.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not used to having a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:19:01.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If I'm going to handle the situation for you, I must work alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:03.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cartel... he is the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.13,0:19:07.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Must be a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:10.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm here for the kidnapping. The liggle girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.07,0:19:12.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Forget the firl. Your assignment is Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.31,0:19:16.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who is Lee and what kind of assignment is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:19.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lee is a foreign detective. A friend of the consul's.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:23.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're to keep him out of sight and away from danger. Understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.52,0:19:27.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I understand. You want me to babysit, but I don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:29.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I came for the big assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.09,0:19:31.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Truth is, this is an FBI operation...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:35.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and I don't need help from the LAPD or some Chung King cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.76,0:19:37.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.46,0:19:42.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you put one of your men on this top-priority case?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.40,0:19:44.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What I supposed to do with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:45.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.47,0:19:48.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want to see him or you until this is resolved.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.74,0:19:50.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,His plane arrives in an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.77,0:19:53.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We want to make a good impression, Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.41,0:19:55.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's his first trip to America.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:19:59.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is bullshit!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:40.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me you speak English.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.45,0:20:47.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm Detective Carter. Do you speak any English?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.23,0:20:54.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you understand the words that are coming out of my mouth?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.34,0:21:02.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I cannot believe this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.21,0:21:05.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,First I get a bullshit assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:05.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now. Mr. Rice-A-Roni...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.08,0:21:09.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...don't even speak American.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:12.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, man. My ride over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.39,0:21:16.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Put yoru bag in the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.72,0:21:25.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Put your bag in the back!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.09,0:21:27.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.73,0:21:33.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You put your own shit in the back! I'm not a skycap.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.24,0:21:35.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm FBI. You understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:39.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell you think this is?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.81,0:21:45.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Captain, I don't think this is funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.21,0:21:49.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Captain. You need to call the FBI and tell them you made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.85,0:21:51.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't do that, Carter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.35,0:21:55.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sure that you and Mr. Lee will have a nice time together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.52,0:21:57.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm warning you. Call the FBI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.39,0:21:59.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,or I'll drop his ass off at Panda Express.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.33,0:22:00.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Drop this case, Carter,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.63,0:22:02.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,you're suspended for two months without pay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.86,0:22:05.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, you can forget about being mayor, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:07.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Congratulations, Carter,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.63,0:22:10.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,it looks like you finally got yourself a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.27,0:22:15.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,One little pinkie get blowed off, man, everybody tripping.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.48,0:22:19.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,"Chinese Consul"?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.18,0:22:22.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's one place you can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.78,0:22:25.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I ain't getting fired for nobody. You going to pay my bills?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.55,0:22:26.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Soo Yung.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.92,0:22:28.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's the little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.82,0:22:32.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.69,0:22:36.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They all think it's real funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.23,0:22:38.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Give Carter the big G-14 classified case.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.53,0:22:40.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll show the FBI they don't know who they playing with.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.83,0:22:42.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll solve this case myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.73,0:22:44.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.98,0:22:58.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I want to show you something first. Look familiar?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.32,0:23:01.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just like home, ain't it? Look. Just like home.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.28,0:23:04.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I ain't never been to China, but I bet it probably look like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.05,0:23:06.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Star maps!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.69,0:23:08.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look, look. John Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.46,0:23:10.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,John Wayne? You know John Wayne?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.76,0:23:13.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,John Wayne.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.56,0:23:14.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, hang out with the Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.73,0:23:17.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll be back. You may see one of your cousins around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.67,0:23:20.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Find them and stalk them! Star maps!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.14,0:23:25.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Right here! Star maps, people!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.97,0:23:27.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You got the address to Michael Jackson house?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:28.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Never-Neverland?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.81,0:23:31.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You can't come around my job! That's harassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.95,0:23:32.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Checking on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.91,0:23:35.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm legit, selling star maps. It's all I sell.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.78,0:23:37.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Legit, my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:40.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What you and your Asian gang friends talk about? Kidnapping?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.89,0:23:42.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.66,0:23:43.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me a star map...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.02,0:23:47.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,for $45. Do you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.19,0:23:51.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know about a kidnapping.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.46,0:23:53.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But some dude's buying guns, explosives
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:54.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and people like he's starting a war.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.67,0:23:56.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's his name? I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.17,0:23:57.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't know his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.20,0:23:58.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For $45, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.20,0:23:59.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For $45, you tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.94,0:24:02.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know nothing for $45.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.94,0:24:06.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't tell you nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.98,0:24:08.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.55,0:24:11.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lee!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.15,0:24:51.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you to wait for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.49,0:24:54.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell you doing on this bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.63,0:24:58.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You think I'm playing with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.83,0:25:01.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Think I'm playing? I ain't playing with you. Sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.60,0:25:09.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's okay. It's all right. FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.00,0:25:10.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take a picture. Wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.28,0:25:19.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.55,0:25:23.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Out of my way! Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.32,0:25:31.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,FBI. Stop this bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.45,0:25:56.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.48,0:25:58.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,FBI. I need this motorcycle. Get off!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.84,0:26:27.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out of the car. Get out of the car now!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.98,0:26:31.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are you going? Didn't I tell you to stay by the Duke?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.18,0:26:32.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.81,0:26:35.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business, stay in the car.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.48,0:26:39.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I just wanted to find out where you was going.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.49,0:26:40.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want to shoot you. I wanted to go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.62,0:26:42.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's happening here?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.22,0:26:47.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Put the gun down. Put the gun down! I ain't playing with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.66,0:26:49.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Think I'm playing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.23,0:26:50.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.10,0:26:53.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Drop your guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.37,0:26:57.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, man... look. FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.37,0:26:59.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm policeman.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.51,0:27:02.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm just showing him how to take a gun from a suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.38,0:27:06.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All of a sudden you speaking English.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.45,0:27:08.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A little. "A little," my ass. You lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.81,0:27:10.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I didn't say I didn't. You assumed I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.95,0:27:14.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,"Assume" I kick your Beijing ass. I ain't scared of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.55,0:27:16.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you know that tricky shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.19,0:27:18.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm not responsible for your assumption.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.72,0:27:21.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You full of shit. You understand? You full of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.59,0:27:24.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not being able to speak is not the same as not speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.86,0:27:26.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You seem as if you like to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.83,0:27:28.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I let people talk who like to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.77,0:27:32.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It makes it easier to find out how full of shit they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.54,0:27:35.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.67,0:27:38.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I like people to talk because it's easy...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.74,0:27:40.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,So I'm the one full of shit?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.08,0:27:41.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We both full of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.88,0:27:43.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You full of shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.15,0:27:48.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going to kick your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.52,0:27:49.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't nobody do that but me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.92,0:27:52.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You want me to kick your ass, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.29,0:28:00.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You must take me to see Consul Han right away.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.30,0:28:03.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just sit there and shut up. This ain't no democracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.27,0:28:06.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.27,0:28:10.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, it ain't. This is the United States of James Carter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.57,0:28:13.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm the president. I'm the emperor. I'm the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.81,0:28:16.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm Michael Jackson, you Tito.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.01,0:28:18.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your ass belong to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.55,0:28:20.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why would they not want my help?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.38,0:28:22.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They don't give a damn about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.58,0:28:24.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They don't like you. I don't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.62,0:28:26.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't care. I'm here for the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.82,0:28:28.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She don't like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.29,0:28:29.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nobody likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.76,0:28:31.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You came all the way here for nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.73,0:28:33.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You ain't going to be...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.33,0:28:35.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Beach Boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.60,0:28:39.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hell, no. You didn't just touch my radio?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.83,0:28:42.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They are great American music.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.04,0:28:44.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The Beach Boys will get you an ass-whupping.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.44,0:28:46.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't ever touch a black man's radio, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.71,0:28:50.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You can do that in China, but you'll get your ass killed here
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.44,0:28:53.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm going to show you real music.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.05,0:28:57.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's music. You hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.32,0:29:11.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can you do that to The Beach Boys? Can you do that to The Beach Boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.00,0:29:12.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.04,0:29:28.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I must get to the consulate. What are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.45,0:29:31.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's called a shakedown. Serious police work.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.71,0:29:34.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Whatch me handle my business and control the space.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.38,0:29:37.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I want to help with the investigation. This is my case.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.09,0:29:41.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your case?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.92,0:29:43.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You can back me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.43,0:29:47.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,When we get in here, you follow my lead and do what I do. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.47,0:29:56.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's up, my nigger? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.34,0:30:00.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is this weed?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.05,0:30:06.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Got a prescription?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.25,0:30:09.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where's it at? Where's it at?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.02,0:30:17.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I should take you to jail.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.69,0:30:19.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.93,0:30:20.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.93,0:30:22.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This ciga-weed!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.26,0:30:23.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look like a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.53,0:30:24.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You better have glaucoma.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.53,0:30:25.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.30,0:30:32.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's up, my nigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.11,0:30:36.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Check that, baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.28,0:30:45.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's happening, Carter?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.02,0:30:49.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Put the guns down. Put the guns down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.19,0:30:52.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,MC Hammer Daddy, put the goddamn gun down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.52,0:30:55.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I got questions and I need answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.39,0:30:56.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Put them down.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.43,0:30:58.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where the girl? What little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.03,0:30:59.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The little girl. What little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.63,0:31:00.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The Chinese girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.66,0:31:02.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know about no girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.47,0:31:03.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.37,0:31:06.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll take you in if I don't get answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.74,0:31:07.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carter, put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.80,0:31:11.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't act like you know me. You don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.31,0:31:14.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I see what's going on. Y'all trying to play me like a fool
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.38,0:31:17.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lee, go outside. It'll get dangerous in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.81,0:31:19.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I may have questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.68,0:31:21.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait by the bar. Remember what I told you?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.98,0:31:24.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Back me up. I'm going to take care of everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.39,0:31:30.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You sure? I'm sure. Now go on. Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.26,0:31:30.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Think I'm playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.96,0:31:33.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.20,0:31:39.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.90,0:31:42.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't come in my business scaring me. Goddamn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.90,0:31:45.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was just playing. Give me a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.21,0:31:47.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm showing that rookie the ropes.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.84,0:31:49.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you come to church Sunday?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.11,0:31:54.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I had some things to take care of. But I made the night service.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.15,0:31:55.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come here. I want to holler at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.25,0:31:57.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.05,0:32:01.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who's running around town buying explosives and weapons?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.05,0:32:02.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know nothing about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.42,0:32:05.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Luke, I know what you do.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.26,0:32:08.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The only reason I ain't busted you because you my cousin...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.33,0:32:09.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and it'd kill Aunt Bootsie.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.66,0:32:13.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why put Aunt Bootsie in this?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.16,0:32:14.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I ain't playing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.67,0:32:18.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She got a bad heart, but if I have to, I'll bust your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.34,0:32:19.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell me something.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.37,0:32:26.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The word in Chinatown is there's a new dude in town
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.48,0:32:30.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,bad-ass dude out of Hong Kong, buying up every goddamn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.22,0:32:30.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.98,0:32:33.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know. He ain't buying from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.25,0:32:35.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't know his name?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.35,0:32:37.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nobody know his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.89,0:32:46.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's up, my nigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.30,0:32:49.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What did you just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.50,0:32:53.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's up, my nigger?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.55,0:33:07.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.28,0:33:11.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What you say, boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.12,0:33:12.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.80,0:34:04.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please... I said I don't want trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.97,0:34:08.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.78,0:34:15.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where the little girl at? What little girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.58,0:34:17.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what firl I'm talking about!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.51,0:34:19.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You better take your hands off my suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.92,0:34:22.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your mama bought me this suit. It's my favorite suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.99,0:34:25.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.06,0:34:27.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll see you Thanksgiving. Appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.59,0:34:31.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get your big Happy Meal ass over in the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.13,0:34:32.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm still the law here!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.66,0:34:35.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Next time I come in, y'all better clean this shit up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.10,0:34:37.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And brush your teeth! Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.87,0:34:43.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are we doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.87,0:34:45.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm getting something to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.44,0:34:47.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You want anything? A Cup of Noodles or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.84,0:34:52.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carter, stop wasting my time. I made a promise to Soo Yung.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.85,0:34:55.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You right. I have been wasting your time. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.95,0:35:00.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me get something to eat. Then I'll take you where you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.42,0:35:01.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.72,0:35:02.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.56,0:35:03.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shake?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.39,0:35:07.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.29,0:35:08.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,YOu not the only one with quick hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.56,0:35:11.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.57,0:35:15.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.64,0:35:21.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I got you a beef and bean burrito.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.42,0:35:38.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We have a taxicab approaching. The man stepping out. Asian.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.29,0:35:40.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,About 5-10.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.46,0:35:44.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Someone's approaching the gate, dropped off by a cab.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.66,0:35:49.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell them to intercept.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.23,0:35:50.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Intercept.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.30,0:35:52.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We will intercept.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.81,0:35:58.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.81,0:36:00.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I must see the Consul.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.88,0:36:02.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.38,0:36:04.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please, it's very important.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.01,0:36:07.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell us why you need to see the Consul.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.02,0:36:08.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll tell you whether it's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.85,0:36:10.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you have identification?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.95,0:36:13.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's about his daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.72,0:36:14.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hands above your head!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.92,0:36:16.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He asked about the Consul's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.63,0:36:18.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He asked about the daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.03,0:36:20.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't understand. I was invited.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.03,0:36:27.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't move! Throw your gun away.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.00,0:36:28.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's going to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.90,0:36:29.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.94,0:36:32.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll be safer on the second floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.41,0:36:36.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry. I'm sorry about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.40,0:36:58.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He went over!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.17,0:37:03.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's on the grounds. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.43,0:37:36.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay away from the window, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.94,0:37:43.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get down, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.22,0:38:00.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.13,0:38:05.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.93,0:38:08.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.43,0:38:15.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Russ, I think there has been a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.94,0:38:18.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's all right. It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.47,0:38:22.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's him... the guy from China.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.04,0:38:23.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.14,0:38:24.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come in, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.08,0:38:33.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Russ, I would like you to meet Detective Inspector Lee.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.85,0:38:35.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.69,0:38:37.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.12,0:38:40.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.00,0:38:46.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where the hell is Carter?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.94,0:38:56.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I got to put up with this. Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.01,0:39:00.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You seen a little Asian dude about this height with a steering wheel on his arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.48,0:39:02.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You seen a little Asian dude about this height with a steering wheel on his arm?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.18,0:39:04.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go screw yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.68,0:39:05.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What did you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.65,0:39:07.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go screw yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.05,0:39:09.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take your sensitive ass up there and let me in. Out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.95,0:39:11.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't make me get out of this truck.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.92,0:39:16.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,When I get in here, I'm slapping somebody. I don't play that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.43,0:39:18.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What happened? Your job was to keep...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.33,0:39:20.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It ain't my job to jump on buses.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.93,0:39:23.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I do not do that! I am not Carl Lewis!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.23,0:39:24.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who is this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.57,0:39:26.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir, I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.70,0:39:29.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Agent Carter has been helping with my investigation.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.67,0:39:33.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's upset that we have not done our job.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.14,0:39:35.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Me and Lee are handling the situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.41,0:39:37.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything's under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.11,0:39:39.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're on top of it. We'll get her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.62,0:39:42.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He is passionate about finding your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.92,0:39:43.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.92,0:39:47.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We wanted Detective Lee to have one of our best men by his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.42,0:39:52.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Agent Russ, this is a good time to tell the Consul the details of my assignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.06,0:39:53.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.43,0:39:56.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carter, can I speak to you for amoment?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.76,0:39:59.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You want to speak to me? In private?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.00,0:40:04.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I see. This must be G-14 classified.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.34,0:40:06.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,FBl-type stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.24,0:40:08.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me call my captain, tell him what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.31,0:40:10.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We'll talk in a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.38,0:40:13.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,G-14. I love when the G-14 be coming around.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.45,0:40:15.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who is this? Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.55,0:40:17.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Am I speaking with FBI?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.62,0:40:20.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The FBI? Yeah, this the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.69,0:40:21.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You are FBI?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.79,0:40:24.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, this is the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.26,0:40:27.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If you want the girl back alive, listen and do not talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.19,0:40:28.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm listening. Let me get a pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.96,0:40:31.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.23,0:40:34.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The drop will be made tonight, 11 p.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.63,0:40:37.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The amount will be 50 million dollar.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.30,0:40:39.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fifty million dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.27,0:40:41.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who you think you kidnapped? Chelsea Clinton?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.71,0:40:42.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Keep him talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.61,0:40:45.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,In used currency. Nothing bigger than a 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.48,0:40:48.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. Fifty million dollars, no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.78,0:40:51.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I want 20 million in 50.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.85,0:40:53.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Twenty million in 50s.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.18,0:40:55.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Twenty million in 20s.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.35,0:40:57.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Twenty million in 20s.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.19,0:40:58.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ten million in 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.96,0:41:03.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And Ten million in 10s. You want any fives with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.03,0:41:04.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.09,0:41:06.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's yours? You called us. Why you want my name?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.90,0:41:08.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I want to tell the Consul
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.86,0:41:12.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,who caused his daughter death because he talk too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.37,0:41:14.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.60,0:41:16.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm trying to hook you up. I'm on yorr side.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.91,0:41:21.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll receive instruction for the drop half an hour before it is to be made.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.68,0:41:25.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If it is successful, the firl will live.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.05,0:41:27.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure you get the money. We can spend it together...
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.98,0:41:31.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,because I don't even work for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.55,0:41:35.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We got it. 620 South Broadway. Downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.60,0:41:51.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tactical Team One, proceed down Sixth to Sixth and Broadway.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.24,0:41:54.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Team Two, I want you around the back at Fourth and Main.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.47,0:41:56.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Set up a perimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.14,0:42:01.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take your team and cover the building floor by floor to the top. Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.86,0:42:12.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They must not go into the building.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.06,0:42:14.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you right. Let's go tell them. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.36,0:42:21.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Russ, you must pull your men back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.23,0:42:23.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing here? Where is Carter?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.64,0:42:28.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.77,0:42:31.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Lee, you may be very competent...
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.07,0:42:35.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but the fact that you know this girl compromises your judgement.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.08,0:42:43.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir, if you were asking for $50 million,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.79,0:42:45.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,would you be in a place like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.96,0:42:48.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get this clown away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.09,0:42:49.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take a hike.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.00,0:42:59.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.97,0:43:01.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why were you hiding?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.14,0:43:02.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What're you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.50,0:43:03.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You were hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.57,0:43:07.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I bent down to tie my shoe and you was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.04,0:43:10.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sir, the area is secured. Room's empty.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.01,0:43:11.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.63,0:43:31.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody, pull back!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.03,0:43:32.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Goddamn!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.30,0:43:34.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get some paramedics here, now!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.23,0:43:37.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Evacuate the building. Get fire crews here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.27,0:43:40.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We got an explosion at Sixth and Broadway.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.06,0:44:45.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That ain't far enough, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.70,0:44:48.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I ain't Kareem Abdul-Jabbar. Push it down some more.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.80,0:45:54.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't come any... Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.75,0:46:20.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Think I done broke my... Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.96,0:46:23.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who was that you was chasing?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.06,0:46:27.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,His name is Sang, from Hong Kong. Because of you, he got away.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.86,0:46:29.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why you didn't tell me about the bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.20,0:46:30.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I did. No, you did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.30,0:46:32.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I did. No, you did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.10,0:46:33.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I said, "Stop!"
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.17,0:46:35.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what you be saying!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.07,0:46:36.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.60,0:46:37.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You see what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.51,0:46:40.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's this in your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.87,0:46:42.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He dropped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.81,0:46:44.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.98,0:46:47.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.15,0:46:48.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I messed up my suit.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.18,0:47:00.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fifteen seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.09,0:47:08.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Make a decision.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.46,0:47:14.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Johnson!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.53,0:47:17.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.54,0:47:20.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Did I come at a bad time?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.91,0:47:24.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I got bad news for you, Johnson. We're all dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.37,0:47:26.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was distracted, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.04,0:47:30.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Distractions occur in the field. That's why we call this practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.31,0:47:32.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If you can't handle the pressure, then quit.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.82,0:47:33.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.82,0:47:35.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Give her a break.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.45,0:47:38.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry about him. How you doing? What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.35,0:47:39.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me some love.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.82,0:47:41.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why are you tormenting me?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.42,0:47:44.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that any way to treat a friend? I came to see how you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.76,0:47:45.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And I need some help.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.86,0:47:46.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Help?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.00,0:47:50.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know you have feelings for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.37,0:47:53.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,but we got to put that aside. There's a girl's life at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.87,0:47:56.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Since when do you care about anybody but yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.24,0:47:57.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Please, take a look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.91,0:48:01.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We found this on the kidnapper. Tell me what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.44,0:48:03.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now you want me to work with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.14,0:48:06.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't have time for this. I got my own shit to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.92,0:48:09.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.78,0:48:11.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry we got you in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.25,0:48:14.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's sorry he got you in trouble. Tell me something about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.72,0:48:17.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a remote. Could be nitro cap, cross delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.49,0:48:19.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not homemade. Definitely not American.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.46,0:48:22.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It could open a garage door or blow up some C-4.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.50,0:48:24.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,C-4?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.20,0:48:25.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, C-4.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.53,0:48:30.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This means so much to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.07,0:48:31.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go, go, go.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.94,0:48:36.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry about spreading those rumors on Christmas about us sleeping together.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.31,0:48:37.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.64,0:48:39.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He's just joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.72,0:48:48.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bobby, what's up, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.22,0:48:51.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I need to see Clive Cobb.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.42,0:48:55.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No way, Carter. It's lights out. They locked down.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.79,0:48:56.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Want me to lose my job?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.79,0:49:00.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I got you this job. You better open the gate and let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.20,0:49:01.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.13,0:49:05.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Didn't I turn my back when you bought that weed?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.07,0:49:06.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was splitting it with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.60,0:49:10.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Didn't I give you the bigger half? Bobby, do me this favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.01,0:49:15.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit. You got five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.14,0:49:18.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, Cobb, your two brothers are here to see you!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.59,0:49:26.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Clive, how you doing, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.76,0:49:29.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You got balls coming here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.32,0:49:31.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was around. I figured you'd be bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.86,0:49:34.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I came to see how you was doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.46,0:49:35.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.83,0:49:37.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I came to bring you a gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.53,0:49:40.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You got time on your hands and I brought you a toy.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.84,0:49:42.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want that. You don't?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.60,0:49:44.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I heard you like to play with stuff like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.74,0:49:47.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't play with stuff like that. I don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.24,0:49:49.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Never sold this to nobody?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.08,0:49:51.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How could I? I don't know what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.25,0:49:54.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Maybe if you hold it. Want to hold it?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.01,0:49:54.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want to touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.72,0:49:56.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why you don't want to touch it? 'Cause I don't want to touch it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.38,0:49:58.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Scared of it? You think I'm stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.59,0:49:59.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stupid enough to get busted.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.65,0:50:01.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You want my fingerprints on it to frame me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.95,0:50:05.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why would I do that? You think I'll trick you again?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.12,0:50:06.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.19,0:50:09.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll do life when they find out you killed the girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.29,0:50:11.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.20,0:50:13.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ain't what I heard. That's what I'll tell everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.40,0:50:15.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't care what you heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.47,0:50:16.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I got a big mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.60,0:50:17.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.80,0:50:21.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know anything about it, so kiss my fat ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.27,0:50:23.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It'd take me all day to kiss your fat ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.48,0:50:27.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What'll you do? Want some of this? I'll give you all you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.14,0:50:28.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.65,0:50:30.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I ain't telling you shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.05,0:50:35.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She's only 11 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.25,0:50:37.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want her to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.62,0:50:39.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look at the picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.56,0:50:43.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't care about him or you! I care about the girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.26,0:50:45.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Give me the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.90,0:50:58.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The guy's name is Juntao.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.11,0:50:59.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I never seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.58,0:51:00.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where can I find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.94,0:51:04.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Foo Chow Restaurant, Chinatown.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.15,0:51:06.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do yourself a favor. Get rid of this guy. He'll get you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.62,0:51:12.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll come and bring your fat ass some cookies. We appreciate this.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.44,0:51:31.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.74,0:51:38.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are we waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.84,0:51:40.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We scoping the place out.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.68,0:51:43.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We ain't going to run in. That's how you get shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.19,0:51:48.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm falling asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.98,0:52:24.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it good for? Absolutely nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.89,0:52:26.86,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Man, you don't know nothing about no "War".
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.86,0:52:28.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody knows "War."
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.33,0:52:34.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What is it good for? Absolutely nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.60,0:52:37.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Good God, you all.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.83,0:52:39.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It ain't "you all". It's "y'all".
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.77,0:52:45.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You sound like a karate movie. Y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.94,0:52:48.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Say it from here with some soul. Y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.15,0:52:54.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let me show your goofy ass how to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.19,0:53:02.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.28,0:53:27.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do that again. Do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.05,0:53:28.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.03,0:54:19.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,One will be inserted in the suitcase. The other will be on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.96,0:54:21.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,When you make the drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.67,0:54:26.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do we have it?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.60,0:54:29.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Pick it up.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.77,0:54:32.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You have what the else about.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.07,0:54:32.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.91,0:54:36.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I hope now you realize how serious I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.01,0:54:37.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take the money to the alley
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.58,0:54:40.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,behind the FOO CHOW Restaurant in Chinatown
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.55,0:54:43.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You have twenty-nine minutes left.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.05,0:54:44.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.26,0:55:00.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Damn, Chin, this some greasy shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.00,0:55:01.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ain't you got no better food,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.37,0:55:04.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,like chicken wings, ribs, fries or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.34,0:55:07.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Chinese food. No sould food here.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.54,0:55:10.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ididn't say soul food. I said, "better food."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.41,0:55:12.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't want that greasy shit. How do you sell a box of grease?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.21,0:55:15.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Umchilia what?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.55,0:55:17.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.72,0:55:18.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm no punk bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.85,0:55:20.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I ain't no punk bitch neither!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.25,0:55:22.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm no punk bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.19,0:55:23.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll knock your hat off.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.59,0:55:25.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Man, what you got me eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.62,0:55:26.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's eel.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.89,0:55:27.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is it good?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.99,0:55:29.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Very good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.53,0:55:31.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What you got?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.20,0:55:32.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Camel's hump.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.36,0:55:33.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.80,0:55:35.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Camel's hump.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.71,0:55:44.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Kind of good!
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.37,0:55:46.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Need a little hot sauce, but it's kind of good.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.54,0:55:51.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're still waiting?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.92,0:55:54.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How do we get this guy, Juntao? How we know he exists?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.72,0:55:57.32,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Nobody ever seen him.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.32,0:55:59.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know. He killed my partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.76,0:56:02.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about that, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.96,0:56:06.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's why I don't have a partner. I learned that from my daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.36,0:56:09.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your daddy was apoliceman?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.70,0:56:11.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fifteen years, LAPD.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.67,0:56:13.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My father was also a policeman.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.70,0:56:14.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He was a cop?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.80,0:56:18.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not a cop. An officer, a legend all over Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.34,0:56:20.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My daddy a legend all over America.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.47,0:56:23.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My daddy once arrest 15 people in one night by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.64,0:56:26.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My daddy arrest 25 by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.71,0:56:30.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My daddy saved 5 crackheads from a burning building by himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.05,0:56:33.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My daddy once caught a bullet with his bare hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.69,0:56:37.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ny daddy would kick you daddy's ass from here to China or Japan,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.12,0:56:39.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,wherever you from and up that Great Wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.69,0:56:40.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't talk about my father.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.59,0:56:42.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't talk about my daddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.33,0:56:46.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That your boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.40,0:56:47.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.50,0:56:52.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I better go in first. Nobody going to recognize me.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.81,0:56:54.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll wait five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.21,0:56:58.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, take my ID. If anything go wrong...
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.81,0:57:00.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,you bust in like you LAPD.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.52,0:57:07.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This won't work. I'm not 6'1".
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.35,0:57:10.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yes, it will. It's all about attitude, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.12,0:57:13.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Flip it open. Flip it closed. Do it fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.76,0:57:17.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You'll get it. Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.46,0:57:18.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.37,0:57:26.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, man, act like you from out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.27,0:57:27.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I am from out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.70,0:57:28.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't act like a cop.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.97,0:57:31.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Act like a tourist or something. Don't be obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.34,0:57:34.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay. No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.78,0:57:36.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.68,0:57:37.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, how you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.95,0:57:38.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For one?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.95,0:57:40.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, for two. I'm here to meet with Mr. Juntao.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.22,0:57:44.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, I don't know Mr. Juntao.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.19,0:57:47.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't understand. I'm his lawyer, legal advisor.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.66,0:57:49.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He got into some shit, said to come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.76,0:57:53.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm very busy. I ain't got time to come, but I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.26,0:57:56.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My wife wants me home, my baby shit all over, needs diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.43,0:57:57.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get Mr. Juntao?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.63,0:57:59.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I already told you, I don't know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.97,0:58:01.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Think I came here for nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.70,0:58:04.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Want to give me gas money? Got $5 on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.67,0:58:07.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go upstairs and tell Mr. Juntao get down here.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.91,0:58:10.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.11,0:58:12.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can I sit right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.41,0:58:13.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.62,0:58:19.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Y'all got any eel?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.05,0:58:20.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.99,0:58:23.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How's your camel hump?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.49,0:58:26.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.46,0:58:28.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where is Roscoe's Chicken and Waffles?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.43,0:58:31.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This way?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.50,0:58:35.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'm from out of town.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.67,0:58:38.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.87,0:58:41.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.52,0:58:56.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.62,0:58:58.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Somebody's asking for Juntao.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.82,0:59:03.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Somebody's asking for Juntao.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.41,0:59:18.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bring him up?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.84,0:59:21.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bring him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.01,0:59:24.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.39,0:59:31.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get the girl out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.95,0:59:35.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Make sure those two don't leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.46,1:00:20.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you ready to order?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.83,1:00:22.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.63,1:00:24.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.77,1:00:31.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Juntao will see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.81,1:00:33.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's about time.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.92,1:00:50.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Let me go!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.27,1:01:03.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.74,1:01:06.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This ain't nothing like downstairs. Y'all got it going.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.94,1:01:09.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's up, man?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.08,1:01:10.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What y'all watching?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.72,1:01:17.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where Juntao at?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.39,1:01:22.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why y'all so quiet?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.86,1:01:31.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That was childish, man. That wasn't even called for!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.03,1:01:35.87,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now I came down here to see Juntao
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.87,1:01:37.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,because he told me to come down here
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.10,1:01:40.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,because I'm his half-brother from Beijing.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.01,1:01:43.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Me, him got the same mama. I'm Blackanese.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.64,1:01:45.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We all the same. Wait a minute!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.98,1:01:47.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You going to kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.28,1:01:50.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Put the gun down, fight me like a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.25,1:01:52.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's right, fight me like a man!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.38,1:01:55.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Anybody can shoot somebody.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.25,1:01:58.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,That's what I'm talking about. Give me room.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.09,1:02:01.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You don't know who you messing with I'll knock.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.06,1:02:07.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Which one of y'all kicked me?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.67,1:02:08.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.70,1:02:14.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.78,1:02:22.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on. Let's talk about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.35,1:02:28.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's talk, hold it a minute.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.59,1:02:31.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What that mean?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.55,1:02:33.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a misunderstanding.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.26,1:02:34.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's pray about this.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.43,1:02:37.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,FBI, huh?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.83,1:02:42.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, I ain't FBI. I'm a security guard at the mall.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.26,1:02:43.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now wipe yourself off.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.10,1:02:46.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're bleeding.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.51,1:02:58.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He just playing, man. He playing, he didn't mean that.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.85,1:03:00.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,He meant cut me loose.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.62,1:03:02.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.52,1:03:03.68,*ENG,,0,0,0,,LAPD!
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.04,1:04:00.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Watch out!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.24,1:04:04.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Behind you!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.91,1:04:08.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carter!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.75,1:04:11.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Freeze!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.68,1:04:17.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We kicked y'all ass. All y'all! I got y'all ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.89,1:04:19.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carter.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.77,1:04:38.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll kill you, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.33,1:05:06.82,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lee, over here!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.88,1:05:23.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Is that my gun?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.48,1:05:27.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It is!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.28,1:05:28.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.12,1:05:33.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How you going to drop the badge?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.36,1:05:37.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then you threw the gun out the window...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.87,1:05:52.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I got everything under control! Don't worry!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.04,1:05:54.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jesus, Mary and Joseph!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.11,1:05:55.34,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's cool.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.34,1:05:58.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why am I not surprised to find you here.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.05,1:06:01.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Dan, I want these two back at the consulate immediately.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.09,1:06:05.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Let's take a ride, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.40,1:06:23.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You better get your hand off me. Hey man, he with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.74,1:06:33.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just let me explain. I'll start from the top.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.38,1:06:34.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We were making the drop.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.78,1:06:38.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Han was about to get his daughter back and you two screwed it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.12,1:06:40.75,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait, didn't you hear what Leee siad?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.75,1:06:43.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Mr. Lee is on his way to Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.52,1:06:47.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get out before I file obstruction of justice charges against you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.46,1:06:49.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We was about to solve this case...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.56,1:06:52.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're no longer on this assignment, Carter!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.76,1:06:54.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Case closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.63,1:06:57.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I only meant to help. Please forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.77,1:07:01.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I must now rely on the FBI.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.74,1:07:03.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,They'll take you to the airport.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.18,1:07:06.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Juntao was behind this.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.45,1:07:09.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Juntao?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.35,1:07:12.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Consul Han!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.72,1:07:13.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.52,1:07:18.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It was all my fault.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.05,1:07:22.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lee would never jeopardize your daughter's life. He loves her.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.89,1:07:25.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's a little too late for apologies, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.80,1:07:28.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Consul...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.60,1:07:29.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,we have a call...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.57,1:07:33.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.20,1:07:34.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Pick it up!
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.81,1:07:39.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The ransom is now 70 million.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.88,1:07:41.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll call tomorrow with instructions.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.94,1:07:44.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Deliver the money, or pick up the body of your daughter.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.71,1:07:47.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You must understand, what happened tonight was not...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.28,1:07:49.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Daddy, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.95,1:07:52.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Soo Yung.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.39,1:07:57.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell them I will do whatever they...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.29,1:07:59.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Soo Yung.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.81,1:08:22.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sorry, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.02,1:08:25.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Be sorry for Soo Yung.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.21,1:08:53.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No hot leads?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.18,1:08:54.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,None.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.14,1:09:00.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen, we're doing everything we can here, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.12,1:09:02.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tracing everything coming into the compound...
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.79,1:09:04.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Consul. You have a guest.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.82,1:09:07.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Jck, let me get back to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.06,1:09:11.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thomas.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.50,1:09:16.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.50,1:09:18.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I couldn't stand by and do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.85,1:09:35.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's up, baby?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.52,1:09:39.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,May, you got guts calling me. I'm going to hang up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.45,1:09:41.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, don't hang up.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.62,1:09:44.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know what? You was right about me, all rigth?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.49,1:09:46.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.13,1:09:47.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Are you on drugs?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.39,1:09:50.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You was right. I was egotistic, inconsiderate.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.83,1:09:54.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was self-centered. I ain't used to partners.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.77,1:09:57.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But it ain't about me, it's about the girl.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.10,1:09:59.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She'll die if we don't help her.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.04,1:10:00.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You understand what I'm saying?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.77,1:10:02.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Not yet, but keep talking.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.97,1:10:05.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I think something's big going down tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.78,1:10:08.88,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I need to find out where the Consul will be.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.88,1:10:09.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Think you can help me?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.48,1:10:12.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll see what I can do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.72,1:10:16.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't need you to "see." I need you to do it. Can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.96,1:10:20.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, Carter.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.29,1:10:21.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, one other thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.93,1:10:24.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What color panties you got on?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.04,1:10:37.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Consul Han, I want you to go to the Chinese Expo as you plan.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.27,1:10:40.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Have the money in the control room. Be sure to make no more mistake.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.94,1:10:43.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I understand, but I want to speak with my daughter!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.63,1:11:07.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, who's the captain on this plane?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.50,1:11:08.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It don't matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.70,1:11:12.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell the captain we got a problem on the left side of this plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.67,1:11:15.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The engine needs a new alternator.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.81,1:11:17.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My supervisior say: "Go fix that plane.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.01,1:11:18.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Put that alternator on it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.04,1:11:20.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't let that plane leave till I come."
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.28,1:11:23.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell the proper authorities not to move this plane...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.12,1:11:26.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,before the FAA come and we in shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.02,1:11:27.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go on!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.96,1:11:36.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.03,1:11:37.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get your ass up now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.03,1:11:38.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We got work to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.73,1:11:40.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go away. I've disgraced myself.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.93,1:11:43.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What about the little girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.23,1:11:45.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Leave me alone. You could never understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.74,1:11:46.80,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A man like me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.80,1:11:48.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You are devoted only to yourself.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.57,1:11:52.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You're ashamed of being an officer. You dishonor your father's name.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.31,1:11:54.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know nothing about my father.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.21,1:11:55.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You say he's a legend.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.81,1:11:57.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My father was a legend
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.38,1:11:59.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,killed making a routine traffic stop...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.72,1:12:02.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,by some punk who didn't want no ticket.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.65,1:12:06.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,His partner's supposed to back him up, but never did.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.02,1:12:08.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My father was as devoted as you.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.49,1:12:09.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And now he's dead. And for what?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.83,1:12:13.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A traffic ticket and some punk? What's the honor in that?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.10,1:12:18.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You believe your father wasted his life, died for nothing?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.37,1:12:21.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then prove me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.84,1:12:27.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,For 15 years, until China resumed control of Hong Kong
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.94,1:12:31.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Juntao was the most powerful crime lord in southeast Asia.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.18,1:12:34.15,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The British tried to close down his operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.15,1:12:37.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But we failed.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.09,1:12:39.19,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But why the Consul's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.19,1:12:40.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Detective Inspector Lee helped me
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.69,1:12:44.16,*ENG,,0,0,0,,raid every known asset of Juntao's operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.16,1:12:47.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We confiscated millions in weapons, cash
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.63,1:12:51.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and a collection of Chinese art that was unsurpassed in the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.90,1:12:55.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Then Juntao disappeared. No witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.00,1:12:58.56,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do you really think he'll kill the girl?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.91,1:13:03.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My advice is...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.11,1:13:06.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,pay the money.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.13,1:13:25.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Consul? I'm going upstairs to make the drop.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.53,1:13:28.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I want you to remain calm, as if nothing's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.50,1:13:31.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't leave Agent Whitney's side even for a moment.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.64,1:13:32.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.79,1:14:31.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Good evening, ladies and gentlemen. I am Consul Han.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.02,1:14:33.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,On behalf of the People's Republic of China,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.69,1:14:35.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,thank you for coming.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.87,1:14:44.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I am pleased to present 5000 years of China's history and heritage.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.50,1:14:49.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,A collection witch, until recently, was thought to be lost forever.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.14,1:14:50.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This some nice shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.91,1:14:53.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Buddha'd go good in my bathroom.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.31,1:14:57.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hey, this is the history of my country.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.52,1:15:00.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Priceless pieces of Chinese culture.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.42,1:15:02.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,If anything gets damaged...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.05,1:15:04.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't worry. Ain't nothing going to happen to this.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.56,1:15:08.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And now, we can pass them on...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.69,1:15:10.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...to our children.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.24,1:15:20.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Pardon me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.04,1:15:29.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I seen that guy at that Chinese restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.01,1:15:32.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Consul Han has been fighting flu for the past few days,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.28,1:15:35.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,so perhaps I should finish what he started.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.05,1:15:37.42,*ENG,,0,0,0,,First we got to clear out the riffraff.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.42,1:15:39.72,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Anybody stay behing, they got something to lose.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.72,1:15:42.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wait here. I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.09,1:15:45.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,...in creating a peaceful future between our two countries.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.29,1:15:48.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The more we see differences and similarities...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.83,1:15:51.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.60,1:15:53.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm Detective Carter from the LAPD.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.43,1:15:54.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We got Carter down here.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.84,1:15:57.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.97,1:16:00.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We received a threat on the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.41,1:16:03.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We ask if you exit the building as soon as possible
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.54,1:16:05.24,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and please do not panic.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.05,1:16:09.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what I said? Get out the door!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.55,1:16:11.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a bomb here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.65,1:16:14.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's this panic about? Have the agents hold positions.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.55,1:16:17.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody, take cover, hold your positions.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.29,1:16:18.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get your ass out the building.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.49,1:16:20.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Lady, put the glass down, get out of here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.63,1:16:23.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Woman, the exit over there or you'll get your head blowed off.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.63,1:16:25.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.87,1:16:29.57,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, titty, titty! Get them titties out of here!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.57,1:16:31.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Somebody grab Carter!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.94,1:16:39.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Juntao.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.65,1:16:40.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Juntao.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.18,1:16:43.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Juntao.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.25,1:16:50.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Consul Han, six blocks of C-4 are wired to your daughter outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.83,1:16:58.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Before the changeover, most of this exhibition
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.66,1:17:00.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,was in the hands of a single private collector.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.83,1:17:04.37,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.37,1:17:06.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I worked most of my life
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.17,1:17:10.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,to acquire and catalog these priceless pieces you see before you
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.38,1:17:14.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And then in one fell swoop...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.61,1:17:18.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,it was taken from me.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.11,1:17:20.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,But tonight
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.12,1:17:22.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I shall be paid in full.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.22,1:17:23.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.95,1:17:27.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She dies if I press this button.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.79,1:17:31.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just be patient.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.66,1:17:33.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My transportation will be here shortly.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.13,1:17:39.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stay calm.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.18,1:17:54.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was going to tell you, you're in the red zone.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.08,1:17:55.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's cops all over.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.52,1:18:01.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Didn't know I could do that, did you? Put your hands up!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.25,1:18:04.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I ain't going to kill you. I'm just going to kick your ass!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.36,1:18:11.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Tell your friends about me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.74,1:18:26.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.38,1:18:29.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We been looking for you. I'm Carter from the LAPD.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.48,1:18:32.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything's okay now. I'll take you to your daddy, all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.58,1:18:34.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,First thing I'll do, I'll take this vest off.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.62,1:18:36.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't touch it!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.12,1:18:37.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I think it'll be safer if we take it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.79,1:18:41.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I heard them say it will explode.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.79,1:18:45.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, I think it'd be safer if we leave it on. Don't move.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.83,1:18:47.83,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.83,1:18:49.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'll be there about five minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.90,1:18:51.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everything is fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.60,1:18:52.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Over!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.60,1:18:53.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.50,1:18:55.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold your positions!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.30,1:18:57.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do not draw your weapons!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.74,1:19:05.98,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, I think we'll call that an evening...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.98,1:19:08.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, and good night.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.97,1:19:29.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Juntao.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.20,1:19:32.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Juntao!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.67,1:19:35.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I got something for you!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.78,1:19:39.18,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I got something you want.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.92,1:19:47.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I got your bomb right here.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.09,1:19:48.09,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Sweetheart.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.09,1:19:49.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.35,1:19:50.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.42,1:19:53.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Want to blow something up?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.73,1:19:55.66,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.46,1:19:59.76,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Push the button. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.07,1:20:02.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Push the button.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.43,1:20:03.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.53,1:20:05.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm playing. Play along.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.14,1:20:06.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, push the button!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.70,1:20:08.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come on, push the button!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.78,1:20:12.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Blow everybody up.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.01,1:20:13.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, blow everybody up!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.54,1:20:14.38,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Push the goddamn button.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.38,1:20:15.74,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Push the goddamn button.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.55,1:20:18.71,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You heard what she said.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.58,1:20:21.69,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.69,1:20:24.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody excited about something blowing up
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.29,1:20:26.02,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and look at your little punk British ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.02,1:20:28.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on! Push the button!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.93,1:20:31.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Deal with it, please.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.36,1:20:32.55,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.93,1:20:41.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Cover the Consul!
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.40,1:20:43.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.40,1:20:45.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's okay. She's professional.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.91,1:20:47.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We must take the vest off.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.44,1:20:49.41,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Okay, give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.41,1:20:50.78,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just give me a second.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.98,1:20:57.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,There's a trigger on this vest. It'll blow if I take it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.62,1:21:04.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Haven't you done this before?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.96,1:21:07.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,It's different in the practice room.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.53,1:21:08.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Everybody take cover.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.26,1:21:11.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We need more men down here!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.63,1:21:14.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Say again! Dan, do you read me?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.31,1:21:28.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Need some help down here, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.49,1:21:36.89,*ENG,,0,0,0,,"Roses are red"
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.42,1:21:39.95,*ENG,,0,0,0,,"Violets are blue"
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.16,1:21:43.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,"Sugar is sweet"
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.60,1:21:47.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,"And so are you"
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.71,1:21:58.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,The remote can still set it off.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.74,1:22:01.00,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.92,1:22:09.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,She okay? Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.95,1:22:13.11,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I know that ain't the bomb!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.46,1:22:18.03,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get that bomb away from me! Take the bomb outside!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.03,1:22:19.29,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Take the bomb outside.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.93,1:22:21.70,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Juntao.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.70,1:22:23.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah, take it over to Juntao. Go to Juntao.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.40,1:22:24.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You go this way. I go that way.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.50,1:22:25.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.97,1:22:33.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't shoot!
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.07,1:23:43.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.72,1:24:02.35,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Where you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.81,1:24:24.97,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Meet me on the roof.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.33,1:24:50.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Don't move, man.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.40,1:24:52.50,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.50,1:24:55.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I been looking for your sweet and sour chicken ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.91,1:24:59.91,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Your boys ain't here. Where they at? You all alone.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.91,1:25:01.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I kill him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.08,1:25:03.77,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Go ahead. I don't like him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.29,1:25:10.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Put your gun down.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.62,1:25:11.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fight like a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.16,1:25:14.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What you say?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.22,1:25:15.49,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fight like a man.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.16,1:25:18.25,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fight like a man?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.30,1:25:25.17,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right. I'll kick your ass. Then I'll take your ass to jail.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.17,1:25:28.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,All right, come on, put the gun down.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.94,1:25:29.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Same time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.50,1:25:57.23,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Wipe yourself off, man. You dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.16,1:27:10.36,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.02,1:27:33.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carter.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.32,1:27:37.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.78,1:28:01.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You know he dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.48,1:28:03.22,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carter.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.22,1:28:05.85,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Help! Do something!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.85,1:28:09.51,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Be cool, man! Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.66,1:28:16.43,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't hold on anymore!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.43,1:28:19.30,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hang on for about a hour! I'll get the ambulance! I'll be back!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.30,1:28:20.46,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.46,1:28:22.07,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Just hang on! I'll be right back!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.07,1:28:23.33,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Carter.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.33,1:28:24.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I was just playing.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.71,1:28:31.04,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Do something!
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.68,1:28:36.58,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I can't hold on anymore.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.76,1:28:56.73,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.74,1:29:03.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.81,1:29:05.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Man, what the hell you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.67,1:29:07.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I just being polite.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.94,1:29:10.14,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Next time, be polite to my nuts.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.14,1:29:11.27,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.35,1:29:13.44,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.75,1:29:16.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.63,1:29:29.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Excuse me. Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.63,1:29:30.65,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.73,1:29:33.60,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I owe you everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.60,1:29:34.96,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Only your friendship.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.01,1:29:41.06,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Look who's here.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.21,1:29:43.61,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What took you so long?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.75,1:29:52.12,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I think this belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.12,1:29:53.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.43,1:30:05.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You should come with me.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.20,1:30:08.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Get on the plane when you get off work. You fly for free.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.20,1:30:11.40,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm a young black man trying to expand my horizons.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.40,1:30:13.53,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Travel a little bit. See the world.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.14,1:30:22.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What y'all doing? I'm through with y'all. I'm going on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.08,1:30:24.21,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Now, hold on there.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.21,1:30:27.62,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We came by to tell you what a great job you did yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.62,1:30:31.45,*ENG,,0,0,0,,And when you come back, there'll be an FBI badge waiting for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.26,1:30:34.81,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.66,1:30:36.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Come on, man, don't be playing.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.49,1:30:41.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I don't know what to say. It's like a dream come true.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.40,1:30:44.13,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I got a idea though.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.17,1:30:51.64,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Why don't y'all take that badge
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.64,1:30:53.54,*ENG,,0,0,0,,and shove it up yoru ass? All up in your ass.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.54,1:30:55.20,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I'm LAPD.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.41,1:30:59.67,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.52,1:31:04.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,First class, I like this. This is tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.92,1:31:06.39,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Can I take your jacket, sir?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.39,1:31:09.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,My jacket? No, you can take this bag though.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.79,1:31:11.79,*ENG,,0,0,0,,How you doing? What's up?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.79,1:31:14.59,*ENG,,0,0,0,,What's up, man? You ready to go?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.59,1:31:16.10,*ENG,,0,0,0,,May I offer you some peanuts?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.10,1:31:17.26,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.20,1:31:19.63,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You are very beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.63,1:31:20.93,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.43,1:31:24.47,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You never told me you spoke Chinese.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.47,1:31:27.84,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I never told you I didn't. You assume I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.84,1:31:31.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,This is cool. Han's letting me go to Hong Kong with you.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.01,1:31:33.08,*ENG,,0,0,0,,I ain't had a vacation in 5 years.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.08,1:31:36.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,We can hang in my crib. I will show you my 'hood.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.31,1:31:38.92,*ENG,,0,0,0,,You can show me some Chinese girls.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.92,1:31:41.28,*ENG,,0,0,0,,When I get there, I want a massage. I'll get buck-wild.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.28,1:31:44.52,*ENG,,0,0,0,,No police work for two weeks... How long this flight?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.02,1:31:46.99,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fifteen hours.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.99,1:31:50.05,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Fifteen hours? What are we going to do for 15 hours?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.40,1:31:59.90,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Hell, no.
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.90,1:32:01.94,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stewardess!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.94,1:32:04.31,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stewardess, give me another seat!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.31,1:32:06.01,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.01,1:32:07.48,*ENG,,0,0,0,,Stewardess!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.05,0:00:49.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,《尖峰时刻》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.80,0:02:30.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.04,0:02:40.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我抓到他了,进来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.75,0:02:42.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,钟涛在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.71,0:02:44.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,钟涛无所不在
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.42,0:02:48.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想跟我斗吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.79,0:02:50.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.29,0:02:53.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,开枪呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.06,0:02:58.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尽管开枪呀
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:03:59.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,姓桑的跑了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.35,0:04:05.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,恕我直言,韩领事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.36,0:04:05.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.20,0:04:10.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,失去你这种正人君子是我们的损失
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.20,0:04:13.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,作为朋友,我跟你并肩作战
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.80,0:04:17.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,整整十五年...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.27,0:04:20.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会想念你对香港皇家警署坚定的支持
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.51,0:04:23.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我谨代表所有
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.68,0:04:26.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,香港皇家警察向你说
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.51,0:04:27.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会想念你
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.58,0:04:28.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,祝你愉快
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.85,0:04:31.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,希望你在美国的新职一切顺利
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.82,0:04:35.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,各位女士先生,韩领事
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.95,0:04:37.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你,汤玛斯
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.83,0:04:42.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们知道
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.66,0:04:45.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,汤玛斯这一席话让我很感动
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:46.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.20,0:04:54.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,葛芬指挥官
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.30,0:04:59.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我为你和香港留下一份大礼
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.14,0:05:03.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,稍早李探长率领飞虎队
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.68,0:05:07.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,将钟涛犯罪集团一网打尽
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.05,0:05:11.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,寻获中国五千年来的无价之宝
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.99,0:05:19.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是我长久以来的心愿
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.89,0:05:21.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,香港万岁
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.73,0:05:24.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,愿香港永远辉煌
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.64,0:05:32.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,素洋
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.67,0:05:35.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么没说你不跟我们去?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.18,0:05:36.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直在找机会说
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.44,0:05:38.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,几时?等我走了?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.88,0:05:43.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,素洋,我会很想你的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.95,0:05:45.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我最好的徒弟
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:47.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你母亲会很骄傲
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.72,0:05:52.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你会继续练习踢腿和眼工吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.16,0:05:54.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我觉得美国不适合我
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.63,0:05:56.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也没有美国的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.76,0:06:01.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一切都会顺利的,我保证
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.33,0:06:04.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你一定最受欢迎
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.77,0:06:06.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.94,0:06:07.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要担心
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.87,0:06:10.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,美国是一个很友好的地方
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.70,0:06:14.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,蠢猪,给我让开
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.71,0:06:13.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.61,0:06:16.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.45,0:06:17.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.31,0:06:18.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你这笨蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.36,0:06:27.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,克莱夫,怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.69,0:06:30.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.29,0:06:32.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我迟到? 对,你迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.03,0:06:35.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我在车上等了一个钟头
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:36.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我在餐厅里面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.73,0:06:37.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我说到餐厅后面
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.80,0:06:39.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你认为我会在前台干这个吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.44,0:06:41.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会坐牢的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.04,0:06:42.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我在餐厅,你没来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.64,0:06:45.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我说过...算了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.24,0:06:47.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,算我没说,办正事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.64,0:06:49.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,干嘛?快收起来
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.04,0:06:50.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想杀人吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.48,0:06:53.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别耍狠,办正事吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.42,0:06:54.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,下次别迟到
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.22,0:06:55.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不会啦,快点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.19,0:07:01.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,酷毙了,太正点了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.66,0:07:03.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么? 塑胶炸药
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.89,0:07:05.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就是这玩意? 没错
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.89,0:07:07.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,妈的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.93,0:07:08.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么了?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.73,0:07:10.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没事,我一直在找这玩意
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.83,0:07:12.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你竟然弄到手了?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.80,0:07:14.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我太高兴了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.60,0:07:16.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,连海珊都弄不到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.74,0:07:18.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你从哪儿弄来的?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:20.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是抢手货
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.01,0:07:21.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我太高兴了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.67,0:07:24.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你手上有货,我去拿钱
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:25.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,从车旁走开
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.15,0:07:29.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,警察先生 把手放在头上
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.02,0:07:30.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么事吗? 乖乖照办
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.85,0:07:33.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没问题,别找我们的碴
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.79,0:07:36.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别乱来,不要乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.76,0:07:37.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要宰了他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.76,0:07:39.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不会的,他是开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.36,0:07:40.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.26,0:07:42.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他在开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.26,0:07:44.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把枪放下
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:46.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他是我表哥,我们在聊天
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.33,0:07:47.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们先走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.67,0:07:48.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.70,0:07:51.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要把他的脑袋轰掉
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.44,0:07:53.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,去吃甜甜圈吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.24,0:07:56.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他抓狂了,让我劝劝他
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.94,0:07:58.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.74,0:08:03.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没事了,他被我撂倒
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.28,0:08:04.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请你们快走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.68,0:08:05.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,手放在头上
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.78,0:08:07.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,警察先生,没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.58,0:08:09.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.64,0:08:29.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谁叫你们不听话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.09,0:08:53.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别开枪,车上有炸药
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.22,0:09:22.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,克莱夫,猜怎么着?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.49,0:09:25.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我忘了说,我是洛城警探
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:27.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你被捕了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.05,0:09:32.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(洛杉矶 中国领事馆)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.65,0:09:35.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快一点,要迟到了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.23,0:09:36.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.50,0:09:38.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.74,0:09:42.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,您的电话,大陆打来的
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.94,0:09:46.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,素洋
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.94,0:09:49.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我爱你,乖乖上学去
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:50.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我放学你会在家吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.15,0:09:56.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不会,我要去接你
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.22,0:10:02.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,再见
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.10,0:10:15.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,喂,我是韩...喂?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.95,0:10:28.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,当你每晚潇洒地走过来
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.25,0:10:30.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谈吐迷人,风度翩翩
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:35.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是我的梦中情人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:37.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为你深深着迷
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.62,0:10:39.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,当你看着我时
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.99,0:10:44.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的心就像小鹿乱撞
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:07.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有问题吗,警官?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.28,0:11:10.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没问题,只是尖峰时刻
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.54,0:12:07.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,保全都没问题吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.17,0:12:10.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这周末能如期展出吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.48,0:12:14.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可以,七点半开幕
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.28,0:12:16.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起,韩领事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.95,0:12:20.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是联邦调查局的罗华伦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.15,0:12:24.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是魏干员,我们私下谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.66,0:12:27.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,失陪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.97,0:12:37.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你很难过
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.74,0:12:40.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但我们一定会找回令嫒
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.27,0:12:42.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她能活着回来吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.14,0:12:45.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,最优秀的干员正在侦办此案
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.64,0:12:49.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想找别人帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.98,0:12:51.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请放心,领事
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.28,0:12:53.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,FBI认为这是重大案件
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.68,0:12:56.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们会出动全力
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.62,0:12:58.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是美国人
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.96,0:13:00.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我女儿也不是美国人
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.92,0:13:02.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.26,0:13:04.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他已经搭机赶来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.79,0:13:09.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,希望他也能受到相同的礼遇
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.90,0:13:12.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.97,0:13:14.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对方有十个
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.80,0:13:17.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,都被我打得落花流水
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.84,0:13:19.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,结果都那两个笨警察搞砸
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.67,0:13:23.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我救了他们,可能会上报
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.41,0:13:25.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我救了他们的命
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.48,0:13:27.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我奋不顾身去追炸药...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.52,0:13:30.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么不找我支援?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.02,0:13:31.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,稍候我会告诉你所有的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.82,0:13:33.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等我下班再讲最精采的部分
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.79,0:13:36.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没人敢跟你合作
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.12,0:13:39.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,难怪只有你没有搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.19,0:13:40.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,强森,第一点
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.73,0:13:43.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想跟我约会就得排队
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.63,0:13:45.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,像别的女人一样
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:47.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我一向单枪匹马
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.23,0:13:48.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,用不着搭档,也不想有搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.87,0:13:50.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也从未有搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.40,0:13:51.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,光头神探有搭档吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.37,0:13:52.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他的胖助手
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.50,0:13:54.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他没办案,哥伦坡也没搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.87,0:13:56.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,戴尔队长命令我协助你
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.51,0:13:58.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,因为你要爆破小组支援
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.71,0:14:01.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把我惹毛对你没好处
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.21,0:14:02.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,外面很危险
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.95,0:14:05.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,坐办公桌比较安全
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.28,0:14:08.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要有团队精神
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.65,0:14:10.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是洛城警探
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.46,0:14:12.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,自由世界最顾人怨的警察
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:15.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我妈觉得丢脸,说我是毒贩
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.33,0:14:17.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,团队个屁,我不会待久
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.86,0:14:19.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我很快就要甩掉你们
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.73,0:14:22.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你很快就要被停职
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.53,0:14:24.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,糗大了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.04,0:14:31.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要被停职?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.28,0:14:34.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别闹了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.85,0:14:38.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你在耍我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.15,0:14:41.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有人说我被停职吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.52,0:14:45.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,事情很棘手
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.76,0:14:48.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想让外国人被打死
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.19,0:14:50.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,变成外交事件
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.63,0:14:52.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他正赶来,怎么办?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.53,0:14:56.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请总部派一名菜鸟干员
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.87,0:14:59.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们陪同这家伙去闲逛一两天
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.34,0:15:01.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,假装带他到处看看风景
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.84,0:15:03.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,然后把他送走
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.14,0:15:06.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真要派联邦干员吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.17,0:15:07.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你说呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.04,0:15:11.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,既然这是个烂差事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.81,0:15:14.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就找洛城警探吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.85,0:15:18.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,即使我有人手
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.22,0:15:20.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,也不肯干这烂差事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.99,0:15:22.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,简直就是丢脸
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.69,0:15:26.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丢我们警局的脸...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.23,0:15:31.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丹,我马上派人去
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.43,0:15:37.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,队长,你一定看过报
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.00,0:15:39.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不是真的,我不会乱来
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.17,0:15:40.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,报纸都是夸大其词 你也知道内幕的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.67,0:15:41.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,讲故事罢了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.84,0:15:43.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,两名警察被射伤
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.14,0:15:44.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一名员警的小指被射断
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.81,0:15:45.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,又没有死人
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.78,0:15:47.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你炸掉半条街
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.41,0:15:48.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那条街早该拆了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.75,0:15:50.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,物证全都被毁
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.25,0:15:51.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还有一点点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.45,0:15:54.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你擅自行动、危害民众
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.92,0:15:56.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想说的是
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.89,0:15:59.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你表现得很好
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.56,0:16:01.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.83,0:16:06.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大家都小心得过头
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.43,0:16:09.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,老是怕出什么错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.40,0:16:11.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你为了抓坏人奋不顾身
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.27,0:16:14.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也是这么想
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.87,0:16:16.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直在跟大家说
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.37,0:16:18.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有时候得让市民知道
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.61,0:16:21.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还是能搞爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.11,0:16:23.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,说得好,这是我的作风
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.75,0:16:25.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我没被停职吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:27.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,停职?怎么会?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:28.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,当我没说过
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.58,0:16:30.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,调查局来找我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.19,0:16:33.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,中共领事的女儿被绑架
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.86,0:16:35.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们要你负责
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.79,0:16:36.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,FBI要我?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.86,0:16:38.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.89,0:16:40.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别唬我 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.33,0:16:42.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,老实说吧 我说的是实话
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.63,0:16:45.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你,队长
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.10,0:16:46.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,恭喜了,卡特
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.57,0:16:48.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,多谢了 你升官了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.54,0:16:51.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等我平步青云后就处理你的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.21,0:16:52.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让你当市长
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.17,0:16:53.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不用了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.34,0:16:59.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听好了,谁想找我
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.71,0:17:03.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要替FBI办一件大案子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.47,0:17:22.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好好替我停车
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.68,0:17:39.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,马上给我准备耳机
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.65,0:17:41.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.79,0:17:44.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,核对国际刑警送来的名单
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.59,0:17:49.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,试着找出什么关联
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.13,0:17:51.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,有什么线索?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.73,0:17:53.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,领事馆的人事记录呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.73,0:17:55.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想知道他都跟谁交谈过
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.10,0:17:56.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跟什么人有来往
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.27,0:17:58.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,向我报告,绑匪有何要求?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.70,0:18:00.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,采到指纹...问过证人吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.70,0:18:04.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,老魏,这家伙是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:05.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给我一份副本
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.61,0:18:08.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,詹姆斯卡特,FBI
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.01,0:18:11.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他是特别任务的人选
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.02,0:18:17.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是负责人罗华伦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.12,0:18:18.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很高兴有你加入
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.15,0:18:19.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直在等待
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.52,0:18:22.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,需要一段时间获得批准
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.56,0:18:24.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡特
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.59,0:18:29.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是G14级最高机密任务
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.60,0:18:33.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我跟你出去边走边说
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.30,0:18:35.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,华伦
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.11,0:18:43.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,G14级最高机密
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.58,0:18:44.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他真会掰
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.85,0:18:46.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不理解的,这是我的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.75,0:18:48.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,当FBI干员就是我的梦想
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.95,0:18:50.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那敢情好,听好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.55,0:18:54.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他姓李,局长亲自交待的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.62,0:18:57.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,恕我直言,他会妨碍我
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.22,0:18:58.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不习惯有搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.86,0:19:01.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我办案通常都是单枪匹马
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.16,0:19:03.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他就是你的案子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.13,0:19:07.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你一定搞错了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.10,0:19:10.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是来办小女孩绑票案的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.07,0:19:12.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别管她,你负责姓李的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.31,0:19:16.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这算哪门子的案子?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.17,0:19:19.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,李探长是韩领事的朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.31,0:19:23.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要保护他不受伤,懂吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.52,0:19:27.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要我当保姆,我不干
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.32,0:19:29.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是来办大案子的
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.09,0:19:31.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,老实说,FBI的案子
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:35.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不用洛城或香港来的警察插手
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.76,0:19:37.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,懂不懂?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.46,0:19:42.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你干嘛不找自己的手下?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.40,0:19:44.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要跟他做什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:45.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不管
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.47,0:19:48.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,反正我不想再见到你们
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.74,0:19:50.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,班机一小时后到
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.77,0:19:53.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好好接待他
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.41,0:19:55.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他第一次来美国
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.88,0:19:59.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,太欺负人了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.08,0:20:40.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你会讲英语吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.45,0:20:47.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是卡特警探,你会英文吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.23,0:20:54.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你听得懂我说的话吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.34,0:21:02.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我真是衰到家了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.21,0:21:05.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,先是接到这烂差事
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:05.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这个功夫小子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.08,0:21:09.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,又不会说英文
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.88,0:21:12.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来吧,那是我的车
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.39,0:21:16.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,行李放后座
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.72,0:21:25.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把行李放在后车座上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.09,0:21:27.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,不,不
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.73,0:21:33.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你自己动手,我不是小弟
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.24,0:21:35.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是联邦干员,懂吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.17,0:21:39.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托你搞清楚状况
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.81,0:21:45.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,队长,这不好笑
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.21,0:21:49.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,打给FBI说你弄错了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.85,0:21:51.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,办不到,卡特
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.35,0:21:55.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你和李先生一定会玩得开心
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.52,0:21:57.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我警告你,通知FBI
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.39,0:21:59.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,否则我在熊猫快餐馆放他鸽子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.33,0:22:00.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,停下这个案子 卡特
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.63,0:22:02.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你将被停职二个月,而且没有工钱
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.86,0:22:05.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,那你也当不上市长
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.80,0:22:07.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,恭喜你 卡特
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.63,0:22:10.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你终于找到搭档了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.27,0:22:15.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,断了根小指就拿我开刀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.48,0:22:19.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,中共领事馆?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.18,0:22:22.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不能去那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.78,0:22:25.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,要是我失业你养我吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.55,0:22:26.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,素洋
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.92,0:22:28.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那个小女孩?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.82,0:22:32.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,说话呀
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.69,0:22:36.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们都在笑我
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.23,0:22:38.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么狗屁G14级机密任务
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.53,0:22:40.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这下FBI把我惹毛了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.83,0:22:42.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要自己办案
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.73,0:22:44.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看我的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.98,0:22:58.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我带你看样东西,眼熟吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.32,0:23:01.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,像不像你的家乡呀?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.28,0:23:04.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我没去过中国,大概就是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.05,0:23:06.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,明星地图
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.69,0:23:08.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你看,约翰韦恩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.46,0:23:10.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道约翰韦恩?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.76,0:23:13.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,约翰韦恩
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.56,0:23:14.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,留下来陪老公爵
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.73,0:23:17.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我马上回来,跟你老表聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.67,0:23:20.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,挖出明星的八卦
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.14,0:23:25.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,明星地图,这儿有在卖
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.97,0:23:27.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你有麦可杰克森的地址吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.74,0:23:28.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,梦幻岛?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.81,0:23:31.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别来骚扰我,好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.95,0:23:32.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我来看你乖不乖
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.91,0:23:35.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是正当生意,我只卖地图
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.78,0:23:37.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,正当个屁
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.02,0:23:40.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你和亚裔帮派聊到绑票案吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.89,0:23:42.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我什么也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.66,0:23:43.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要买地图
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.02,0:23:47.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,45块一张,说不说?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.19,0:23:51.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道绑票案
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.46,0:23:53.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不过有人买了一大堆枪和炸药
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.00,0:23:54.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,人们以为他要开战呢
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.67,0:23:56.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他叫什么? 我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.17,0:23:57.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不知道他叫什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.20,0:23:58.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只给45块我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.20,0:23:59.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你得说些线索
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.94,0:24:02.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我什么也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.94,0:24:06.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我什么也没说
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.98,0:24:08.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,李
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.55,0:24:11.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,李
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.15,0:24:51.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫你等我
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.49,0:24:54.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你上巴士干什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.63,0:24:58.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是说着玩的
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.83,0:25:01.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想跟你玩游戏,坐下来
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.60,0:25:09.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没事,联邦干员
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.00,0:25:10.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尽管拍,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.28,0:25:19.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,够了
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.55,0:25:23.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让开,小心
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.32,0:25:31.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,FBI,快停车
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.45,0:25:56.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,停车
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.48,0:25:58.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要这辆摩托车,下车
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.84,0:26:27.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给我下车,马上下车
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.98,0:26:31.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫你别乱跑,你想去哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.18,0:26:32.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你搞什么鬼?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.81,0:26:35.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别多管闲事
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.48,0:26:39.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我想知道你去哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.49,0:26:40.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要跟你去
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.62,0:26:42.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.22,0:26:47.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把枪放下,我不是闹着玩
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.66,0:26:49.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,想死吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.23,0:26:50.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.10,0:26:53.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把枪放下
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.37,0:26:57.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,老兄,我是FBI
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.37,0:26:59.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是警察
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.51,0:27:02.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我正在教他怎么夺枪
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.38,0:27:06.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么突然会讲英文?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.45,0:27:08.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只会一点点 才怪,你骗我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.81,0:27:10.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我没骗你,是你假设的
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.95,0:27:14.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小心我扁你,我才不怕你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.55,0:27:16.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然你会功夫
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.19,0:27:18.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你自己笨,别怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.72,0:27:21.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是什么屁话?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.59,0:27:24.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不说话不等于是哑巴
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.86,0:27:26.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你这么爱说话
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.83,0:27:28.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我就让你说个够
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.77,0:27:32.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,反正你说的都是屁话
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.54,0:27:35.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你刚才说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.67,0:27:38.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你说的都是屁话
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.74,0:27:40.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我说的是屁话?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.08,0:27:41.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们都一样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.88,0:27:43.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你这个骗子
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.15,0:27:48.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要揍扁你
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.52,0:27:49.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这一招我也会
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.92,0:27:52.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你真是欠扁,是吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.29,0:28:00.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,带我去找韩领事
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.30,0:28:03.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给我闭嘴,这不是民主国家
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.27,0:28:06.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这里是
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.27,0:28:10.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,才不是,这是我的国家
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.57,0:28:13.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是总统、国王、皇帝
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.81,0:28:16.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是麦可杰克森,你谁都不是
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.01,0:28:18.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你得听我的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.55,0:28:20.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们为什么不要我帮忙?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.38,0:28:22.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们懒得理你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.58,0:28:24.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我和他们都不喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.62,0:28:26.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是来救小女孩的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.82,0:28:28.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她也不喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.29,0:28:29.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没人喜欢你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.76,0:28:31.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你白来了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:31.73,0:28:33.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你别想要...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.33,0:28:35.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,海滩男孩合唱团
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.60,0:28:39.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,想都别想,别碰我的收音机
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.83,0:28:42.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,最好的美国音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.04,0:28:44.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小心我扁你
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.44,0:28:46.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别碰老黑的收音机
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.71,0:28:50.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在中国没关系,在这儿会没命
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.44,0:28:53.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是真正的美国音乐
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.05,0:28:57.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这才够霹雳,听到吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.32,0:29:11.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听海滩男孩能跳舞吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.00,0:29:12.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,才不能
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.04,0:29:28.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要去领事馆,这是哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.45,0:29:31.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要抄这地方,重要警务
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.71,0:29:34.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看我怎么搞定他们
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.38,0:29:37.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要帮忙,这是我的案子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.09,0:29:41.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的案子?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.92,0:29:43.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,到一边凉快去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.43,0:29:47.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,待会我怎么做你就怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.47,0:29:56.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么样,老黑? 怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.34,0:30:00.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是大麻吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.05,0:30:06.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有处方吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.25,0:30:09.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在哪里?在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.02,0:30:17.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我大可以抓你
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.69,0:30:19.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,凭什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.93,0:30:20.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这只是香烟
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.93,0:30:22.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是大麻烟
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.26,0:30:23.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么看都是香烟
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.53,0:30:24.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你有白内障
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.53,0:30:25.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.30,0:30:32.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么样,老黑?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.11,0:30:36.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,瞧瞧是谁来了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.28,0:30:45.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你好吗,卡特?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.02,0:30:49.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把枪放下,放下来
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.19,0:30:52.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,吹气老爹,把枪放下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.52,0:30:55.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给我乖乖回答
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.39,0:30:56.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把枪放下
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.43,0:30:58.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那个小女孩呢? 什么小女孩?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.03,0:30:59.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就是那个小女孩 什么小女孩?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.63,0:31:00.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,中国小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.66,0:31:02.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道什么小女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.47,0:31:03.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你知道我在说什么!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.37,0:31:06.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,得不到答案,我抓你坐牢
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.74,0:31:07.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡特,把枪放下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.80,0:31:11.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,装作你不认识我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.31,0:31:14.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道了,你们想要骗我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.38,0:31:17.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,李,出去,这里太危险
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.81,0:31:19.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也有问题要问
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.68,0:31:21.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听好,到吧台等我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.98,0:31:24.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,帮帮忙,我能搞定
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.39,0:31:30.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真的吗? 当然了,去吧,快去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.26,0:31:30.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.96,0:31:33.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.20,0:31:39.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给我过来
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.90,0:31:42.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,该死,别跑来吓我
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.90,0:31:45.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是装的,抱一下
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.21,0:31:47.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是吓吓那菜鸟
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.84,0:31:49.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你都不上教堂
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.11,0:31:54.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我很忙,不过我晚上有去
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.15,0:31:55.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,过来,我要问你
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.25,0:31:57.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,问什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.05,0:32:01.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谁在到处买枪和炸药?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.05,0:32:02.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.42,0:32:05.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,路克,我知道你卖军火
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.26,0:32:08.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是我表弟,要是我抓你
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.33,0:32:09.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,布阿姨会难过死了
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.66,0:32:13.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你提她干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.16,0:32:14.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是说着玩
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.67,0:32:18.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就算她心脏不好我照样抓你
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.34,0:32:19.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给我一点线索
Dialogue: 0,0:32:22.37,0:32:26.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听说唐人街来了个狠角色
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.48,0:32:30.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,香港人,他在到处搜购武器
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.22,0:32:30.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他叫什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.98,0:32:33.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不知道,我没卖给他
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.25,0:32:35.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不知道他叫什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.35,0:32:37.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没有人知道
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.89,0:32:46.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么样,老黑?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.30,0:32:49.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.50,0:32:53.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么样,老黑?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.55,0:33:07.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.28,0:33:11.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你说什么,小子?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.12,0:33:12.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想惹麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.80,0:34:04.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,求求你们,我不想惹麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.97,0:34:08.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,吸烟对身体不好
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.78,0:34:15.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小女孩在哪里? 什么小女孩?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.58,0:34:17.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你清楚得很
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.51,0:34:19.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把你的臭手拿开
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.92,0:34:22.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,衣服是你老妈买给我的
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.99,0:34:25.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给我放手
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.06,0:34:27.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,感恩节见,多谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.59,0:34:31.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给我滚到角落去
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.13,0:34:32.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我才是老大
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.66,0:34:35.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,下次最好给我乖一点
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.10,0:34:37.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,记得要刷牙,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.87,0:34:43.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来这里干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.87,0:34:45.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,买东西吃
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.44,0:34:47.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要什么?泡面?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.84,0:34:52.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别浪费时间,我答应过素洋
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.85,0:34:55.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真抱歉,我浪费了你的时间
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.95,0:35:00.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等我先吃饱再带你去
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.42,0:35:01.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可以吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.72,0:35:02.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.56,0:35:03.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一言为定
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.39,0:35:07.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.29,0:35:08.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的身手也不赖
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.56,0:35:11.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.57,0:35:15.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.64,0:35:21.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我替你买了墨西哥牛肉卷
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.42,0:35:38.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有辆计程车,亚裔男子下车
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.29,0:35:40.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,五尺十寸
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.46,0:35:44.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有人坐计程车到领事馆
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.66,0:35:49.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把他拦下来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.23,0:35:50.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拦下来
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.30,0:35:52.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们去
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.81,0:35:58.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你有什么事?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.81,0:36:00.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要见领事
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.88,0:36:02.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.38,0:36:04.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这件事很重要
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.01,0:36:07.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,先说出你找领事有什么事
Dialogue: 0,0:36:07.02,0:36:08.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们再决定重不重要
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.85,0:36:10.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你有身份证吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.95,0:36:13.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是他女儿的事
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.72,0:36:14.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,手举起来
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.92,0:36:16.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他提到领事的女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.63,0:36:18.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他提到那女孩
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.03,0:36:20.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是他请我来的
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.03,0:36:27.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别动,把枪丢掉
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.00,0:36:28.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他要杀死他们
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.90,0:36:29.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.94,0:36:32.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,到二楼比较安全
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.41,0:36:36.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起,真是抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.40,0:36:58.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他翻过墙
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.17,0:37:03.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他进去了,快点
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.43,0:37:36.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别靠近窗口
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.94,0:37:43.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快趴下
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.22,0:38:00.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.13,0:38:05.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,我来晚了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.93,0:38:08.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你等一等
Dialogue: 0,0:38:12.43,0:38:15.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,罗先生,这是个误会
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.94,0:38:18.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没事了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.47,0:38:22.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是他,香港来的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.04,0:38:23.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.14,0:38:24.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请进
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.08,0:38:33.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,罗先生,这位是李探长
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.85,0:38:35.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真是抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.69,0:38:37.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.12,0:38:40.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的枪
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.00,0:38:46.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡特在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.94,0:38:56.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我真是衰,你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.01,0:39:00.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你有没有看到一个这么高的小个子亚洲人
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.48,0:39:02.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他的手里拿着方向盘?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.18,0:39:04.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.68,0:39:05.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.65,0:39:07.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,去死吧
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.05,0:39:09.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快让我进去,滚开
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.95,0:39:11.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别逼我下车
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.92,0:39:16.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我一定要扁人,开什么玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.43,0:39:18.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事,你要负责...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:18.33,0:39:20.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我可不想跑来跑去
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.93,0:39:23.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不干,我又不是刘易士
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.23,0:39:24.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这个人是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.57,0:39:26.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我可以解释
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.70,0:39:29.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡特干员在协助我办案
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.67,0:39:33.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,破不了案他很生气
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.14,0:39:35.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我和李能处理
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.41,0:39:37.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没有问题
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.11,0:39:39.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们一定能找到她
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.62,0:39:42.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他很努力找你女儿
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.92,0:39:43.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.92,0:39:47.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我派最优秀的干员协助李探长
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.42,0:39:52.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是一个好机会,你应该跟领事说说我的任务
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.06,0:39:53.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.43,0:39:56.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡特,我想跟你谈谈
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.76,0:39:59.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想私下跟我谈?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.00,0:40:04.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这一定是G14级最高机密
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.34,0:40:06.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,FBI的事
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.24,0:40:08.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我先打给队长,告诉他进展情况
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.31,0:40:10.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等我一下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.38,0:40:13.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我最爱G14级最高机密了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.45,0:40:15.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁?喂?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.55,0:40:17.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是FBI干员吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.62,0:40:20.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,FBI?我是FBI干员
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.69,0:40:21.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是FBI?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.79,0:40:24.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.26,0:40:27.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,想要那女孩就乖乖听话
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.19,0:40:28.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我在听,我拿支笔
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.96,0:40:31.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.23,0:40:34.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,今晚十一点交钱
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.63,0:40:37.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,赎金是五千万元
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.30,0:40:39.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,五千万?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.27,0:40:41.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你以为你绑走柯林顿女儿吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.71,0:40:42.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,继续说下去
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.61,0:40:45.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要旧钞,五十元以下
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.48,0:40:48.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好,五千万,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.78,0:40:51.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要两千万的五十元钞票
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.85,0:40:53.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,两千万要五十元钞票
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.18,0:40:55.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,另外两千万要二十元钞票
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.35,0:40:57.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,两千万要二十元钞票
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.19,0:40:58.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一千万要十元钞票
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.96,0:41:03.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一千万十元,要五元钞票吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.03,0:41:04.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你叫什么名字?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.09,0:41:06.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你呢?是你先打来的
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.90,0:41:08.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要告诉领事
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.86,0:41:12.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他的话太多才会把女儿害死
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.37,0:41:14.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好啦,冷静点
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.60,0:41:16.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我这是在帮你耶
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.91,0:41:21.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,交款前半小时我会再联络你
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.68,0:41:25.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我拿到赎金才放人质
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.05,0:41:27.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你一定拿得到,咱们一起花
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.98,0:41:31.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,反正我不是FBI的人
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.55,0:41:35.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,查到了,南百老汇620号
Dialogue: 0,0:41:46.60,0:41:51.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一号小组,前往百老汇街
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.24,0:41:54.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,二号小组,绕到缅因街后面
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.47,0:41:56.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,封锁现场
Dialogue: 0,0:41:56.14,0:42:01.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,带上你的队伍,从上到下搜索那栋大楼,快去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.86,0:42:12.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们不能进去
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.06,0:42:14.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没错,快去跟他们说
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.36,0:42:21.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要把人手叫回来
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.23,0:42:23.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在这儿干嘛?卡特呢?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.64,0:42:28.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请你听我说
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.77,0:42:31.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,虽然你很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.07,0:42:35.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,但事实是你认识的这个女孩会影响你的判断力
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.08,0:42:43.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他要求五千万元赎金
Dialogue: 0,0:42:43.79,0:42:45.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,会躲在这种地方吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.96,0:42:48.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把这小丑带走
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.09,0:42:49.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快滚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.00,0:42:59.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.97,0:43:01.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你干嘛躲起来?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.14,0:43:02.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在说什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:02.50,0:43:03.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你躲起来
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.57,0:43:07.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是蹲下去绑鞋带
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.04,0:43:10.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,封锁现场,房间是空的
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.01,0:43:11.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.63,0:43:31.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大伙快撤退
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.03,0:43:32.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.30,0:43:34.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快叫救护车
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.23,0:43:37.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,进行撤退,快叫消防车
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.27,0:43:40.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,六街和百老汇街口发生爆炸
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.06,0:44:45.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我够不到,老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:44:45.70,0:44:48.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是贾霸,下来一点
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.80,0:45:54.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要过来,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.75,0:46:20.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我好像扯断...该死
Dialogue: 0,0:46:20.96,0:46:23.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在追谁呀?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:23.06,0:46:27.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,香港来的桑,你害我把他追丢
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.86,0:46:29.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么没警告我?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.20,0:46:30.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我有 才没有
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.30,0:46:32.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我有 没有
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.10,0:46:33.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我叫你站住
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.17,0:46:35.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我没有听懂
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.07,0:46:36.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.60,0:46:37.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这就对了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.51,0:46:40.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你拿的是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.87,0:46:42.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他掉下来的
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.81,0:46:44.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可恶,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:46:45.98,0:46:47.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,上哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.15,0:46:48.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我把西装弄皱了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.18,0:47:00.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,十五秒
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.09,0:47:08.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,赶快决定
Dialogue: 0,0:47:13.46,0:47:14.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,强森
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.53,0:47:17.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.54,0:47:20.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我来得不是时候?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.91,0:47:24.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,坏消息,我们都死了
Dialogue: 0,0:47:24.37,0:47:26.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我受到干扰
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.04,0:47:30.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一定会有干扰,所以才要演习
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.31,0:47:32.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你受不了压力就退出
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.82,0:47:33.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是,长官
Dialogue: 0,0:47:33.82,0:47:35.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别找她的碴
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.45,0:47:38.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别管他,你好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.35,0:47:39.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,亲一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.82,0:47:41.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么老是折磨我?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.42,0:47:44.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别这样嘛,我来看你耶
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.76,0:47:45.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也要你帮个忙
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.86,0:47:46.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.00,0:47:50.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道你对我有意思
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.37,0:47:53.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不过先别提,那女孩有危险
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.87,0:47:56.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么关心起别人?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.24,0:47:57.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你看看
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.91,0:48:01.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,绑匪掉的,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.44,0:48:03.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要我跟你搭档?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.14,0:48:06.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要这样,我的麻烦够多了
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.92,0:48:09.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你是谁?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:09.78,0:48:11.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉我们害你惹上麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.25,0:48:14.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是他害你惹麻烦,别怪我
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.72,0:48:17.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是摇控器,用来引爆炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:48:17.49,0:48:19.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,肯定不是美国制造
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.46,0:48:22.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可以开车库或引爆塑胶炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.50,0:48:24.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,塑胶炸弹?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.20,0:48:25.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对,塑胶炸弹
Dialogue: 0,0:48:27.53,0:48:30.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你的帮忙
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.07,0:48:31.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快滚吧
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.94,0:48:36.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不该散播谣言说咱们在圣诞节上过床
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.31,0:48:37.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:37.64,0:48:39.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他在开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,0:48:46.72,0:48:48.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,巴比,你好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:50.22,0:48:51.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要见克莱夫
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.42,0:48:55.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不行,现在不准见人犯
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.79,0:48:56.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别害我被炒鱿鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.79,0:49:00.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是我帮你找到差事的,快开门
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.20,0:49:01.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:49:01.13,0:49:05.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大麻那档事我饶过你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.07,0:49:06.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那次你也有份
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.60,0:49:10.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你分的最多,帮个忙嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:49:13.01,0:49:15.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.14,0:49:18.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,龙兄虎弟来找你了
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.59,0:49:26.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,克莱夫,你好吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.76,0:49:29.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你还敢跑来?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.32,0:49:31.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我正好经过,你一定很无聊
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.86,0:49:34.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,所以顺便来看看你
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.46,0:49:35.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.83,0:49:37.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我来送你礼物
Dialogue: 0,0:49:37.53,0:49:40.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,反正你有空,我带了玩具来
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.84,0:49:42.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不要 是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.60,0:49:44.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听说你爱玩这调调
Dialogue: 0,0:49:44.74,0:49:47.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我才不爱玩,这是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.24,0:49:49.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你没卖给别人?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.08,0:49:51.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我都不知道这是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.25,0:49:54.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,摸摸看,要不要?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.01,0:49:54.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想摸
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.72,0:49:56.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为什么 是我不想
Dialogue: 0,0:49:56.38,0:49:58.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你怕吗?我才没有那么笨
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.59,0:49:59.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你够笨才被抓
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.65,0:50:01.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你想骗我留下指纹
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.95,0:50:05.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么会?我不会骗你
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.12,0:50:06.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我没有必要
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.19,0:50:09.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,反正等他们发现你杀死那女孩,你就得坐一辈子牢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:09.29,0:50:11.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我什么也不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:50:11.20,0:50:13.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我听说你什么都知道
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.40,0:50:15.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不在乎
Dialogue: 0,0:50:15.47,0:50:16.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是大嘴巴
Dialogue: 0,0:50:16.60,0:50:17.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你给我听好
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.80,0:50:21.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我就是不知道,怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.27,0:50:23.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你这浑蛋真是欠扁
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.48,0:50:27.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,干嘛?想打架?尽管来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:27.14,0:50:28.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,说出一个名字
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.65,0:50:30.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我什么也不说
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.05,0:50:35.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她才十一岁
Dialogue: 0,0:50:35.25,0:50:37.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能让她死
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.62,0:50:39.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看看这照片
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.56,0:50:43.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不在乎你们,我只在乎她
Dialogue: 0,0:50:44.26,0:50:45.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快招出来
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.90,0:50:58.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那家伙叫钟涛
Dialogue: 0,0:50:58.11,0:50:59.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我没见过他
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.58,0:51:00.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.94,0:51:04.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,唐人街福州餐馆
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.15,0:51:06.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你最好甩掉他,他会害死你
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.62,0:51:12.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,下次我带饼干给你,谢了
Dialogue: 0,0:51:30.44,0:51:31.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,在这儿
Dialogue: 0,0:51:36.74,0:51:38.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们还等什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:38.84,0:51:40.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们得先探探路
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.68,0:51:43.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,硬闯进去一定会受伤
Dialogue: 0,0:51:47.19,0:51:48.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我快要睡着了
Dialogue: 0,0:52:21.98,0:52:24.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么用?一点也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:52:24.89,0:52:26.86,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不会唱《战争》这首歌
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.86,0:52:28.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,每个人都会唱
Dialogue: 0,0:52:30.33,0:52:34.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有什么用?一点也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.60,0:52:37.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,上天保佑
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.83,0:52:39.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是老天保佑啦
Dialogue: 0,0:52:43.77,0:52:45.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你好像在吆喝卖药
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.94,0:52:48.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要有点感情
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.15,0:52:54.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我就教你几招吧
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.19,0:53:02.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来呀,来呀
Dialogue: 0,0:53:24.28,0:53:27.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,再来一次,再来一次
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.05,0:53:28.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这样吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:17.03,0:54:19.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一个装在皮箱,一个在你身上
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.96,0:54:21.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你交钱的时候...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.67,0:54:26.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好了吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.60,0:54:29.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,接吧
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.77,0:54:32.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有没有拿到钱?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.07,0:54:32.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.91,0:54:36.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,希望你知道我是玩真的
Dialogue: 0,0:54:36.01,0:54:37.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把钱带到巷子
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.58,0:54:40.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就在中国城福州餐馆的后面
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.55,0:54:43.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你只有29分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.05,0:54:44.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你自己去
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.26,0:55:00.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真是的,这道菜太油腻
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.00,0:55:01.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没有清淡一点的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.37,0:55:04.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,像是烤排骨、炸薯条之类的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:05.34,0:55:07.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只有中国菜,没有老黑菜
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.54,0:55:10.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我没说老黑,我是说清淡
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.41,0:55:12.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不爱油腻,这太油了
Dialogue: 0,0:55:14.21,0:55:15.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么玩意?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:15.55,0:55:17.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,过来
Dialogue: 0,0:55:17.72,0:55:18.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是你马子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.85,0:55:20.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我也不是你马子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.25,0:55:22.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不是你马子
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.19,0:55:23.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小心我扁你
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.59,0:55:25.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你点了什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:25.62,0:55:26.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,鳗鱼
Dialogue: 0,0:55:26.89,0:55:27.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吃吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.99,0:55:29.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.53,0:55:31.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在吃什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.20,0:55:32.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,驼峰
Dialogue: 0,0:55:32.36,0:55:33.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.80,0:55:35.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,驼峰
Dialogue: 0,0:55:42.71,0:55:44.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,挺好吃的
Dialogue: 0,0:55:44.37,0:55:46.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,沾点辣椒酱会更好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:55:48.54,0:55:51.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还在等吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:52.92,0:55:54.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,该怎么逮到钟涛这家伙?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:54.72,0:55:57.32,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没有人见过他
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.32,0:55:59.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道,他杀死我的搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.76,0:56:02.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很遗憾,老兄
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.96,0:56:06.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,所以我像我爸不找搭档
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.36,0:56:09.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你爸是警察?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:09.70,0:56:11.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,洛城警局,十五年
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.67,0:56:13.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我父亲也是警察
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.70,0:56:14.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.80,0:56:18.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他是警官,香港传奇人物
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.34,0:56:20.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我老爸是美国传奇人物
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.47,0:56:23.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一个晚上就逮了十五个人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.64,0:56:26.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我父亲逮了二十五个
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.71,0:56:30.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我老爸从火堆救出五个人
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.05,0:56:33.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我父亲徒手接住子弹
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.69,0:56:37.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我老爸能把你老爸踢到爪哇国
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.12,0:56:39.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,然后再踢到万里长城
Dialogue: 0,0:56:39.69,0:56:40.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别批评我父亲
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.59,0:56:42.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别说我老爸坏话
Dialogue: 0,0:56:45.33,0:56:46.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就是他吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.40,0:56:47.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对,走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.50,0:56:52.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我先进去,没人认得我
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.81,0:56:54.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我等五分钟
Dialogue: 0,0:56:56.21,0:56:58.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拿我的警徽,要是出事
Dialogue: 0,0:56:58.81,0:57:00.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,假装是洛城警探闯进来
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.52,0:57:07.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不行,我不够高
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.35,0:57:10.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,当然行,只要有架势
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.12,0:57:13.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只要亮一下就行,动作要快
Dialogue: 0,0:57:15.76,0:57:17.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你学得会的
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.46,0:57:18.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拿去
Dialogue: 0,0:57:24.37,0:57:26.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,装一副外地人的样子
Dialogue: 0,0:57:26.27,0:57:27.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我本来就是外地人
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.70,0:57:28.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别显得像个警察
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.97,0:57:31.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,装成观光客,不要太嚣张
Dialogue: 0,0:57:31.34,0:57:34.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好,没问题
Dialogue: 0,0:57:35.78,0:57:36.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎光临
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.68,0:57:37.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.95,0:57:38.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一位吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:38.95,0:57:40.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,两位,我来找钟涛
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.22,0:57:44.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,我不认识他
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.19,0:57:47.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是他的律师
Dialogue: 0,0:57:47.66,0:57:49.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他有麻烦,叫我来找他
Dialogue: 0,0:57:49.76,0:57:53.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我很忙,不过还是来了
Dialogue: 0,0:57:53.26,0:57:56.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我老婆要我回家替宝宝换尿布
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.43,0:57:57.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快去叫他
Dialogue: 0,0:57:57.63,0:57:59.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我说我不认识他
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.97,0:58:01.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不想白跑一趟
Dialogue: 0,0:58:01.70,0:58:04.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,给我点油钱,五块钱
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.67,0:58:07.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,到楼上叫他下来
Dialogue: 0,0:58:08.91,0:58:10.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.11,0:58:12.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我能坐吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:12.41,0:58:13.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.62,0:58:19.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有鳗鱼吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:19.05,0:58:20.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有
Dialogue: 0,0:58:20.99,0:58:23.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,驼峰好吃吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:24.49,0:58:26.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.46,0:58:28.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,南方炸鸡店在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.43,0:58:31.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这儿吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.50,0:58:35.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抱歉,我是外地人
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.67,0:58:38.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.87,0:58:41.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那是什么?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:54.52,0:58:56.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,0:58:56.62,0:58:58.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,老板,有人在下面找钟涛
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.82,0:59:03.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有人在下面找钟涛
Dialogue: 0,0:59:17.41,0:59:18.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把他带上来吗?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.84,0:59:21.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,带他上来
Dialogue: 0,0:59:23.01,0:59:24.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: 0,0:59:30.39,0:59:31.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把人质带走
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.95,0:59:35.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别让那两个人活着离开
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.46,1:00:20.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,先生你决定了没有?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.83,1:00:22.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.63,1:00:24.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.77,1:00:31.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,钟涛要见你了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.81,1:00:33.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,该是时候了
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.92,1:00:50.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,住手,放开我
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.27,1:01:03.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,棒呆了
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.74,1:01:06.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,比楼下好多了,正点
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.94,1:01:09.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:09.08,1:01:10.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看什么看?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.72,1:01:17.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,钟涛的人呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:21.39,1:01:22.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,干嘛这么安静?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.86,1:01:31.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,太可恶了,你们真没礼貌
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.03,1:01:35.87,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我来找钟涛
Dialogue: 0,1:01:35.87,1:01:37.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他自己叫我来的
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.10,1:01:40.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是他北京的兄弟
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.01,1:01:43.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,同母异父,我算是中黑人
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.64,1:01:45.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们是同胞,住手
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.98,1:01:47.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要杀我?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.28,1:01:50.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,枪放下,咱们单打独斗
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.25,1:01:52.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,像个真正的男子汉
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.38,1:01:55.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,三岁小孩都会用枪
Dialogue: 0,1:01:55.25,1:01:58.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这样才对,让开点
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.09,1:02:01.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你们是找死
Dialogue: 0,1:02:06.06,1:02:07.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是谁踢我?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.67,1:02:08.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.70,1:02:14.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.78,1:02:22.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你过来一下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:25.35,1:02:28.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好话好商量
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.59,1:02:31.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你说什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:31.55,1:02:33.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是个误会
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.26,1:02:34.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,祷告吧
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.43,1:02:37.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,联邦调查局?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.83,1:02:42.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不是,我只是警卫
Dialogue: 0,1:02:42.26,1:02:43.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,擦一下
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.10,1:02:46.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在流血
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.51,1:02:58.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他在开玩笑,不是说真的
Dialogue: 0,1:02:58.85,1:03:00.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他要替我松绑
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.62,1:03:02.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.52,1:03:03.68,*CHS,,0,0,0,,洛城警探
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.04,1:04:00.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小心
Dialogue: 0,1:04:03.24,1:04:04.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你后面
Dialogue: 0,1:04:07.91,1:04:08.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡特
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.75,1:04:11.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.68,1:04:17.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们把你们打得惨兮兮
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.89,1:04:19.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡特
Dialogue: 0,1:04:36.77,1:04:38.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要宰了你
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.33,1:05:06.82,*CHS,,0,0,0,,李,那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.88,1:05:23.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是我的枪吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.48,1:05:27.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是耶
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.28,1:05:28.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:05:32.12,1:05:33.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么会把警徽丢掉?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:35.36,1:05:37.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你还把枪丢出去
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.87,1:05:52.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我都搞定了,别担心
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.04,1:05:54.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的老天
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.11,1:05:55.34,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.34,1:05:58.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,又是你们两个
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.05,1:06:01.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把这两个家伙带回领事馆
Dialogue: 0,1:06:04.09,1:06:05.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跟我走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.40,1:06:23.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别碰我,他跟我一起的
Dialogue: 0,1:06:30.74,1:06:33.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让我从头跟你解释
Dialogue: 0,1:06:33.38,1:06:34.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们在付赎金
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.78,1:06:38.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快要救出人质就被你们搞砸
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.12,1:06:40.75,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你没听到李说的吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.75,1:06:43.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,李先生正被送回香港
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.52,1:06:47.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快滚吧,别让我告你阻碍办案
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.46,1:06:49.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们快要破案了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.56,1:06:52.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你被撤下来了,卡特
Dialogue: 0,1:06:52.76,1:06:54.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别再说了
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.63,1:06:57.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是一心想帮忙,请原谅我
Dialogue: 0,1:06:57.77,1:07:01.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我只能依赖FBI把素洋找回来
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.74,1:07:03.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们会送你到机场
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.18,1:07:06.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道一定是钟涛干的
Dialogue: 0,1:07:08.45,1:07:09.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,钟涛?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:11.35,1:07:12.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,韩领事
Dialogue: 0,1:07:12.72,1:07:13.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.52,1:07:18.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,全是我的错
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.05,1:07:22.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,李很爱你女儿,不会害她
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.89,1:07:25.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在道歉太迟了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.80,1:07:28.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,韩领事
Dialogue: 0,1:07:28.60,1:07:29.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,绑匪来电
Dialogue: 0,1:07:30.57,1:07:33.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,都好了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:33.20,1:07:34.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,接吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:37.81,1:07:39.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在赎金是七千万
Dialogue: 0,1:07:39.88,1:07:41.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,明天通知交钱方法
Dialogue: 0,1:07:41.94,1:07:44.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不交钱就收尸吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:44.71,1:07:47.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请你相信,今晚的事...
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.28,1:07:49.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸你还好吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:50.95,1:07:52.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,素洋
Dialogue: 0,1:07:54.39,1:07:57.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跟他们说我一定照办
Dialogue: 0,1:07:58.29,1:07:59.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,素洋
Dialogue: 0,1:08:21.81,1:08:22.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很遗憾,老兄
Dialogue: 0,1:08:24.02,1:08:25.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为素洋遗憾吧
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.50,1:08:50.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,(洛杉矶 国际机场)
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.21,1:08:53.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没有线索?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.18,1:08:54.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没有
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.14,1:09:00.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听好,我们已经尽力而为
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.12,1:09:02.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,追查所有的电话
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.79,1:09:04.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起,你有访客
Dialogue: 0,1:09:05.82,1:09:07.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,待会再打给你
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.06,1:09:11.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,汤玛斯
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.50,1:09:16.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很遗憾,老友
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.50,1:09:18.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不能坐视不顾
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.85,1:09:35.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么样,宝贝?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.52,1:09:39.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你还敢找我,我要挂断了
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.45,1:09:41.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等等,别挂断
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.62,1:09:44.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我以前真是不应该
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.49,1:09:46.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.13,1:09:47.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在嗑药吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.39,1:09:50.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你说得没错,我自大无礼
Dialogue: 0,1:09:50.83,1:09:54.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不顾别人死活
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.77,1:09:57.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不过这次你要想想那小女孩
Dialogue: 0,1:09:57.10,1:09:59.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不帮忙她就会死
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.04,1:10:00.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你懂吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.77,1:10:02.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,还不懂,继续说
Dialogue: 0,1:10:02.97,1:10:05.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,今晚会发生大事
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.78,1:10:08.88,*CHS,,0,0,0,,告诉我领事在哪里
Dialogue: 0,1:10:08.88,1:10:09.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你能帮忙吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:11.48,1:10:12.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会尽力而为
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.72,1:10:16.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别说你会尽力,我要你办到
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.96,1:10:20.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好吧,卡特
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.29,1:10:21.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,很好,我再问你
Dialogue: 0,1:10:22.93,1:10:24.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的内裤什么颜色?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:33.04,1:10:37.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要你照计划参加开幕晚会
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.27,1:10:40.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把钱放在控制室,别乱来
Dialogue: 0,1:10:40.94,1:10:43.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要跟我女儿讲话
Dialogue: 0,1:11:04.63,1:11:07.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起,机长是谁?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:07.50,1:11:08.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.70,1:11:12.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,跟他说飞机有点问题
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.67,1:11:15.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,引擎得换新的交流发电机
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.81,1:11:17.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我的老板说,“去修好飞机
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.01,1:11:18.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,安装那个发电机
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.04,1:11:20.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,先别让这班飞机起飞”
Dialogue: 0,1:11:20.28,1:11:23.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,千万别让人登机
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.12,1:11:26.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,先等民航局检查过再说
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.02,1:11:27.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快去呀
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.96,1:11:36.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在这儿干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.03,1:11:37.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,起来吧
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.03,1:11:38.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,咱们得干活
Dialogue: 0,1:11:38.73,1:11:40.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走开,我犯了错
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.93,1:11:43.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小女孩呢?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:43.23,1:11:45.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别管我,你不会懂
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.74,1:11:46.80,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你这什么意思?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.80,1:11:48.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你只管自己死活
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.57,1:11:52.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,丢了警局也丢了你父亲的脸
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.31,1:11:54.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不认识我老爸
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.21,1:11:55.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你说他是传奇人物
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.81,1:11:57.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我爸的确是
Dialogue: 0,1:11:57.38,1:11:59.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他在开罚单的时候遇害
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.72,1:12:02.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有个混混对他不爽
Dialogue: 0,1:12:02.65,1:12:06.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他的搭档却没有出来帮他
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.02,1:12:08.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我老爸跟你一样尽职
Dialogue: 0,1:12:08.49,1:12:09.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他为什么殉职?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:09.83,1:12:13.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,为了张罚单?这有何尊严?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.10,1:12:18.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你认为他死得没有意义?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:20.37,1:12:21.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请你证明我错了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.84,1:12:27.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,香港回归前十五年来
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.94,1:12:31.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,钟涛是势力最大的黑道老大
Dialogue: 0,1:12:32.18,1:12:34.15,*CHS,,0,0,0,,英国政府想打垮他
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.15,1:12:37.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,却失败了
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.09,1:12:39.19,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他为何绑走领事的女儿?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:39.19,1:12:40.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,李探长帮助我
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.69,1:12:44.16,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把他们一网打尽
Dialogue: 0,1:12:44.16,1:12:47.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没收价值数千万的枪支、现金
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.63,1:12:51.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,和价值连城的古董
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.90,1:12:55.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,后来他消失无踪,没人看过他
Dialogue: 0,1:12:57.00,1:12:58.56,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你认为他会撕票?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.91,1:13:03.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我建议你
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.11,1:13:06.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,付出赎金
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.13,1:13:25.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,领事,我要上楼交钱
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.53,1:13:28.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请你装作没有事
Dialogue: 0,1:13:28.50,1:13:31.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要离开魏干员一步
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.64,1:13:32.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我知道
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.79,1:14:31.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,各位晚安,我是韩领事
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.02,1:14:33.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,代表中华人民共和国
Dialogue: 0,1:14:33.69,1:14:35.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,欢迎各位到来
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.87,1:14:44.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我有幸介绍中国五千年的宝藏
Dialogue: 0,1:14:44.50,1:14:49.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这些古物最近才被发现
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.14,1:14:50.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好棒的古董
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.91,1:14:53.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,佛像适合摆我家
Dialogue: 0,1:14:55.31,1:14:57.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是中国的历史文物
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.52,1:15:00.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,象征中国文化的无价之宝
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.42,1:15:02.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,要是有所损坏
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.05,1:15:04.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别怕,不会有事的
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.56,1:15:08.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在,我们终于能够...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.69,1:15:10.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...传承给下一代
Dialogue: 0,1:15:19.24,1:15:20.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.04,1:15:29.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我在餐馆看过这家伙
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.01,1:15:32.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,韩领事这几天感冒
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.28,1:15:35.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,让我替他说完
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.05,1:15:37.42,*CHS,,0,0,0,,先把这些人赶走
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.42,1:15:39.72,*CHS,,0,0,0,,留下来的就是坏蛋
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.72,1:15:42.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.09,1:15:45.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...为了中美两国的未来
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.29,1:15:48.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,只有互相交流和了解...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.83,1:15:51.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.60,1:15:53.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是洛城警探卡特
Dialogue: 0,1:15:53.43,1:15:54.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡特在那儿
Dialogue: 0,1:15:56.84,1:15:57.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么回事?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:57.97,1:16:00.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们收到炸弹威胁
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.41,1:16:03.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请各位尽速离开
Dialogue: 0,1:16:03.54,1:16:05.24,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请不要惊慌
Dialogue: 0,1:16:07.05,1:16:09.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听到吗?快逃命吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.55,1:16:11.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这里有炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.65,1:16:14.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,搞什么?大家守住岗位
Dialogue: 0,1:16:14.55,1:16:17.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大伙儿守住岗位
Dialogue: 0,1:16:17.29,1:16:18.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,滚出大楼
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.49,1:16:20.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拜托,放下酒杯,快逃吧
Dialogue: 0,1:16:21.63,1:16:23.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,出口在那儿,你不要命吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:24.63,1:16:25.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快呀,快呀
Dialogue: 0,1:16:26.87,1:16:29.57,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快逃命吧,快点
Dialogue: 0,1:16:29.57,1:16:31.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,抓住卡特
Dialogue: 0,1:16:37.94,1:16:39.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,钟涛
Dialogue: 0,1:16:39.65,1:16:40.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,钟涛
Dialogue: 0,1:16:42.18,1:16:43.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你就是钟涛
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.25,1:16:50.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你女儿身上绑了六块塑胶炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:16:55.83,1:16:58.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,香港回归前这些古物
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.66,1:17:00.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,属于一名私人收藏家所有
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.83,1:17:04.37,*CHS,,0,0,0,,就是我
Dialogue: 0,1:17:04.37,1:17:06.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我辛苦一辈子
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.17,1:17:10.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,才收集到你们眼前的无价之宝
Dialogue: 0,1:17:12.38,1:17:14.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没想到一下子...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:15.61,1:17:18.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...就被夺走
Dialogue: 0,1:17:18.11,1:17:20.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不过今晚...
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.12,1:17:22.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,...我会得到补偿
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.22,1:17:23.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.95,1:17:27.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我按下去她就死
Dialogue: 0,1:17:29.79,1:17:31.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,有点耐心
Dialogue: 0,1:17:31.66,1:17:33.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,马上就有人来接我
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.13,1:17:39.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,冷静点
Dialogue: 0,1:17:52.18,1:17:54.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的车停在红线
Dialogue: 0,1:17:54.08,1:17:55.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,到处都是警察
Dialogue: 0,1:17:58.52,1:18:01.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没想到吧?手举起来
Dialogue: 0,1:18:01.25,1:18:04.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不会杀你,我会扁你
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.36,1:18:11.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,多替我宣传吧
Dialogue: 0,1:18:24.74,1:18:26.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你没事吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.38,1:18:29.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是洛城警探卡特
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.48,1:18:32.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不会有事的,我带你找爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.58,1:18:34.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不过我先帮你脱掉背心
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.62,1:18:36.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不能碰
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.12,1:18:37.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,脱下来比较安全
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.79,1:18:41.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他们说脱下来就会爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.79,1:18:45.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那就不要脱,别动
Dialogue: 0,1:18:45.83,1:18:47.83,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在哪里?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.83,1:18:49.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大概还有五分钟就可以到了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.90,1:18:51.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,现在一切都很顺利
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.60,1:18:52.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,完毕
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.60,1:18:53.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别动
Dialogue: 0,1:18:53.50,1:18:55.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.30,1:18:57.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:19:01.74,1:19:05.98,*CHS,,0,0,0,,各位,今晚就告一段落
Dialogue: 0,1:19:05.98,1:19:08.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢大家,晚安
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.97,1:19:29.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,钟涛
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.20,1:19:32.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,钟涛
Dialogue: 0,1:19:34.67,1:19:35.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我有东西给你
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.78,1:19:39.18,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你要的东西
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.92,1:19:47.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是你的炸弹
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.09,1:19:48.09,*CHS,,0,0,0,,女儿
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.09,1:19:49.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.35,1:19:50.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别去
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.42,1:19:53.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,想炸死我们吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.73,1:19:55.66,*CHS,,0,0,0,,来呀
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.46,1:19:59.76,*CHS,,0,0,0,,按下去呀
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.07,1:20:02.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快按呀
Dialogue: 0,1:20:02.43,1:20:03.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:03.53,1:20:05.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我在唬他,一起唬他吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.14,1:20:06.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,尽管按下去
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.70,1:20:08.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,是啊,尽管按吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:10.78,1:20:12.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,炸死大家最好
Dialogue: 0,1:20:12.01,1:20:13.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对,把大家炸死
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.54,1:20:14.38,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快按吧
Dialogue: 0,1:20:14.38,1:20:15.74,*CHS,,0,0,0,,按下去
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.55,1:20:18.71,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你听到她的话
Dialogue: 0,1:20:20.58,1:20:21.69,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快呀
Dialogue: 0,1:20:21.69,1:20:24.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,大家都好兴奋
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.29,1:20:26.02,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你却怕得要命
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.02,1:20:28.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快点,按下去
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.93,1:20:31.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,搞定他
Dialogue: 0,1:20:31.36,1:20:32.55,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你上哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:39.93,1:20:41.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,保护领事
Dialogue: 0,1:20:42.40,1:20:43.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不,不
Dialogue: 0,1:20:43.40,1:20:45.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别怕,她是爆破专家
Dialogue: 0,1:20:45.91,1:20:47.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一定要脱掉背心
Dialogue: 0,1:20:47.44,1:20:49.41,*CHS,,0,0,0,,等我一下子
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.41,1:20:50.78,*CHS,,0,0,0,,再等一下
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.98,1:20:57.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,背心有机关,脱掉就会爆炸
Dialogue: 0,1:21:03.62,1:21:04.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你没拆除过吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:04.96,1:21:07.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这跟演习不同
Dialogue: 0,1:21:07.53,1:21:08.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快找掩护
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.26,1:21:11.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请派人手支援
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.63,1:21:14.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,请重覆,你收到吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.31,1:21:28.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快派人来支援
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.49,1:21:36.89,*CHS,,0,0,0,,玫瑰艳丽
Dialogue: 0,1:21:38.42,1:21:39.95,*CHS,,0,0,0,,紫罗兰娇美
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.16,1:21:43.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,糖果甜蜜
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.60,1:21:47.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你也一样
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.71,1:21:58.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他能用摇控器引爆
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.74,1:22:01.00,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快脱掉吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.92,1:22:09.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,她没事吧? 没事
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.95,1:22:13.11,*CHS,,0,0,0,,那不是炸弹吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:14.46,1:22:18.03,*CHS,,0,0,0,,离我远点,把炸弹拿出去
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.03,1:22:19.29,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快把它拿出去
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.93,1:22:21.70,*CHS,,0,0,0,,钟涛
Dialogue: 0,1:22:21.70,1:22:23.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,拿给钟涛,拿给他
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.40,1:22:24.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你走那儿,我走这儿
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.50,1:22:25.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,走吧
Dialogue: 0,1:22:32.97,1:22:33.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,别开枪
Dialogue: 0,1:23:43.07,1:23:43.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.72,1:24:02.35,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你上哪儿?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:23.81,1:24:24.97,*CHS,,0,0,0,,到屋顶等我
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.33,1:24:50.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不要动
Dialogue: 0,1:24:51.40,1:24:52.50,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好了
Dialogue: 0,1:24:52.50,1:24:55.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我一直在找你这块咕老肉
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.91,1:24:59.91,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你的手下都不在
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.91,1:25:01.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我会杀死他的
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.08,1:25:03.77,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我讨厌他,尽管下手吧
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.29,1:25:10.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把枪放下
Dialogue: 0,1:25:10.62,1:25:11.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我们单打独斗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.16,1:25:14.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你说什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.22,1:25:15.49,*CHS,,0,0,0,,单打独斗
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.16,1:25:18.25,*CHS,,0,0,0,,单打独斗?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.30,1:25:25.17,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好,我先扁你,再送你坐牢
Dialogue: 0,1:25:25.17,1:25:28.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,好了,把枪放下
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.94,1:25:29.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,一起放下
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.50,1:25:57.23,*CHS,,0,0,0,,擦一下,你死了
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.16,1:27:10.36,*CHS,,0,0,0,,感谢上帝
Dialogue: 0,1:27:32.02,1:27:33.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡特
Dialogue: 0,1:27:36.32,1:27:37.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,该死
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.78,1:28:01.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,他死了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:01.48,1:28:03.22,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡特
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.22,1:28:05.85,*CHS,,0,0,0,,救命啊,快想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:28:05.85,1:28:09.51,*CHS,,0,0,0,,冷静点,撑着点
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.66,1:28:16.43,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我抓不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:16.43,1:28:19.30,*CHS,,0,0,0,,再撑一小时,我去叫救护车
Dialogue: 0,1:28:19.30,1:28:20.46,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在鬼扯什么?
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.46,1:28:22.07,*CHS,,0,0,0,,撑着点,我马上回来
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.07,1:28:23.33,*CHS,,0,0,0,,卡特
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.33,1:28:24.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我只是开玩笑
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.71,1:28:31.04,*CHS,,0,0,0,,快想办法
Dialogue: 0,1:28:34.68,1:28:36.58,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我撑不住了
Dialogue: 0,1:28:55.76,1:28:56.73,*CHS,,0,0,0,,糟糕
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.74,1:29:03.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.81,1:29:05.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你在干嘛?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:05.67,1:29:07.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是礼貌呀
Dialogue: 0,1:29:07.94,1:29:10.14,*CHS,,0,0,0,,下次别那么用力
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.14,1:29:11.27,*CHS,,0,0,0,,对不起
Dialogue: 0,1:29:12.35,1:29:13.44,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:29:14.75,1:29:16.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,1:29:28.63,1:29:29.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你没事吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:29.63,1:29:30.65,*CHS,,0,0,0,,没事
Dialogue: 0,1:29:31.73,1:29:33.60,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我欠你很多
Dialogue: 0,1:29:33.60,1:29:34.96,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你只欠我一份友情
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.01,1:29:41.06,*CHS,,0,0,0,,看看这是谁
Dialogue: 0,1:29:42.21,1:29:43.61,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你怎么现在才来?
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.75,1:29:52.12,*CHS,,0,0,0,,这是你的
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.12,1:29:53.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.43,1:30:05.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你应该跟我去
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.20,1:30:08.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,下了班就搭免费飞机来
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.20,1:30:11.40,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我这老黑能扩展你的视野
Dialogue: 0,1:30:11.40,1:30:13.53,*CHS,,0,0,0,,环游世界、见见世面
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.14,1:30:22.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,干嘛?我要去度假
Dialogue: 0,1:30:22.08,1:30:24.21,*CHS,,0,0,0,,先别急着走
Dialogue: 0,1:30:24.21,1:30:27.62,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你昨天的表现太好了
Dialogue: 0,1:30:27.62,1:30:31.45,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你回来就能当FBI干员
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.26,1:30:34.81,*CHS,,0,0,0,,真的吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.66,1:30:36.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你不要骗我
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.49,1:30:41.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我太感动了,我的梦想成真
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.40,1:30:44.13,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我有个点子
Dialogue: 0,1:30:45.17,1:30:51.64,*CHS,,0,0,0,,把那些FBI徽章拿出来
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.64,1:30:53.54,*CHS,,0,0,0,,塞进你们的屁眼
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.54,1:30:55.20,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我是洛城警探
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.41,1:30:59.67,*CHS,,0,0,0,,臭小子
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.52,1:31:04.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,头等舱,棒呆了
Dialogue: 0,1:31:04.92,1:31:06.39,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我帮你拿外套
Dialogue: 0,1:31:06.39,1:31:09.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,不必了,帮我拿行李吧
Dialogue: 0,1:31:09.79,1:31:11.79,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你好,怎么样?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.79,1:31:14.59,*CHS,,0,0,0,,怎么样?走了吧?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:14.59,1:31:16.10,*CHS,,0,0,0,,您要来点花生吗?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:16.10,1:31:17.26,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:18.20,1:31:19.63,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你很美
Dialogue: 0,1:31:19.63,1:31:20.93,*CHS,,0,0,0,,谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,1:31:22.43,1:31:24.47,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你没说你会讲中文
Dialogue: 0,1:31:24.47,1:31:27.84,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我没说我不会,是你假设的
Dialogue: 0,1:31:27.84,1:31:31.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,酷毙了,老韩让我跟你去香港
Dialogue: 0,1:31:31.01,1:31:33.08,*CHS,,0,0,0,,五年来我没度过假
Dialogue: 0,1:31:33.08,1:31:36.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,你住我的窝,我带你到处混
Dialogue: 0,1:31:36.31,1:31:38.92,*CHS,,0,0,0,,带我找中国小妞
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.92,1:31:41.28,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我要去按摩,狂欢作乐
Dialogue: 0,1:31:41.28,1:31:44.52,*CHS,,0,0,0,,享受两个礼拜,要飞多久?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.02,1:31:46.99,*CHS,,0,0,0,,十五个钟头
Dialogue: 0,1:31:46.99,1:31:50.05,*CHS,,0,0,0,,十五个钟头?要做什么呀?
Dialogue: 0,1:31:58.40,1:31:59.90,*CHS,,0,0,0,,我不要
Dialogue: 0,1:31:59.90,1:32:01.94,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小姐
Dialogue: 0,1:32:01.94,1:32:04.31,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小姐,我要换座位
Dialogue: 0,1:32:04.31,1:32:06.01,*CHS,,0,0,0,,听我说
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.01,1:32:07.48,*CHS,,0,0,0,,小姐
